helix:cs_absence_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Absence Type" ; skos:notation "helix/absence-type" .
helix:cs_absence_type__vacation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "vacation" ; skos:prefLabel "Vacation/Annual Leave" ; skos:definition "Paid time off accrued based on length of service and appointment type. Accrual rates and maximum balances vary by employee class. Faculty on academic-year appointments typically do not accrue vacation." .
helix:cs_absence_type__sick a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "sick" ; skos:prefLabel "Sick Leave" ; skos:definition "Paid leave for personal illness, medical appointments, or care of an immediate family member. Many states mandate sick leave accrual. Some institutions have sick leave donation/sharing programs." .
helix:cs_absence_type__personal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "personal" ; skos:prefLabel "Personal Leave" ; skos:definition "Paid leave for personal business not covered by other leave categories. Typically limited to 2-3 days per year. May or may not require advance approval." .
helix:cs_absence_type__fmla a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "fmla" ; skos:prefLabel "FMLA Leave" ; skos:definition "Leave protected under the Family and Medical Leave Act. Up to 12 weeks of job-protected, unpaid leave per year for qualifying reasons (serious health condition, new child, military family). Runs concurrent with paid leave if available." .
helix:cs_absence_type__military a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "military" ; skos:prefLabel "Military Leave" ; skos:definition "Leave for military service under USERRA (Uniformed Services Employment and Reemployment Rights Act). Job-protected with reemployment rights. Many institutions provide differential pay (difference between military and civilian pay)." .
helix:cs_absence_type__bereavement a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "bereavement" ; skos:prefLabel "Bereavement Leave" ; skos:definition "Paid leave following the death of a family member. Duration typically varies by relationship (3-5 days for immediate family, 1 day for extended family). Definition of 'family' varies by policy." .
helix:cs_absence_type__jury_duty a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "jury_duty" ; skos:prefLabel "Jury Duty" ; skos:definition "Leave for serving on a jury or responding to a subpoena. Most institutions provide paid leave for the duration of service. Employee may be required to submit jury fee to the institution." .
helix:cs_absence_type__sabbatical a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "sabbatical" ; skos:prefLabel "Sabbatical Leave" ; skos:definition "Extended leave (typically one semester at full pay or one year at half pay) granted to tenured or senior faculty for research, writing, or professional development. Usually available after 6-7 years of service. Requires application and approval." .
helix:cs_absence_type__parental a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "parental" ; skos:prefLabel "Parental Leave" ; skos:definition "Leave for birth, adoption, or foster placement of a child. May be paid or unpaid depending on institutional policy. Increasingly offered as a standalone benefit beyond FMLA. Typically 6-12 weeks." .
helix:cs_absence_type__administrative a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "administrative" ; skos:prefLabel "Administrative Leave" ; skos:definition "Paid leave directed by the institution, typically during an investigation, restructuring, or emergency. Not initiated by the employee. May be with or without restrictions on campus access." .
helix:cs_absence_type__workers_compensation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "workers_compensation" ; skos:prefLabel "Workers' Compensation Leave" ; skos:definition "Leave due to a work-related injury or illness covered under state workers' compensation law. Benefits include medical treatment and wage replacement (typically 2/3 of average weekly wage, subject to state maximums)." .
helix:cs_absence_type__unpaid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "unpaid" ; skos:prefLabel "Unpaid Leave of Absence" ; skos:definition "Approved leave without pay when paid leave is exhausted or not applicable. Employment relationship maintained but benefits eligibility may be affected. Often requires VP/provost approval beyond a certain duration." .
helix:cs_absence_type__professional_development a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_absence_type ; skos:notation "professional_development" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional Development Leave" ; skos:definition "Leave for attending conferences, workshops, certifications, or training. Usually paid with expenses covered by the department or professional development fund." .
helix:cs_account_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Chart of Accounts, Account Type" ; skos:notation "helix/account-type" .
helix:cs_account_type__asset a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "asset" ; skos:prefLabel "Asset" ; skos:definition "Resources owned or controlled by the institution with future economic benefit. Includes cash, investments, receivables (student, grants, pledges), prepaid expenses, capital assets (land, buildings, equipment), inventories, and deferred outflows of resources." .
helix:cs_account_type__liability a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "liability" ; skos:prefLabel "Liability" ; skos:definition "Obligations of the institution. Includes accounts payable, accrued payroll, unearned revenue (deferred tuition), bonds payable, capital leases, compensated absences liability, pension liability (GASB 68/75), and deferred inflows of resources." .
helix:cs_account_type__fund_balance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "fund_balance" ; skos:prefLabel "Fund Balance / Net Position" ; skos:definition "The residual of assets minus liabilities. GASB uses 'net position' with categories: net investment in capital assets, restricted (expendable and nonexpendable), and unrestricted. FASB uses 'net assets' with categories: without donor restrictions and with donor restrictions." .
helix:cs_account_type__revenue a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "revenue" ; skos:prefLabel "Revenue" ; skos:definition "Inflows of resources. Major categories in higher ed: tuition and fees, state appropriations, federal grants and contracts, auxiliary enterprise revenue, gifts and pledges, investment income, hospital/clinical revenue, and other operating revenue." .
helix:cs_account_type__expenditure a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "expenditure" ; skos:prefLabel "Expenditure / Expense" ; skos:definition "Outflows of resources for operations. Classified by function (instruction, research, public service, academic support, student services, institutional support, operation of plant, scholarships/fellowships, auxiliary enterprises, hospital) and by natural classification (salaries, benefits, supplies, travel, equipment, utilities, depreciation)." .
helix:cs_account_type__transfer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_account_type ; skos:notation "transfer" ; skos:prefLabel "Transfer" ; skos:definition "Movement of funds between fund groups that is not a revenue or expenditure. Includes mandatory transfers (debt service, matching requirements) and non-mandatory transfers (internal allocations, overhead recovery distributions). Must balance, every transfer-out has a corresponding transfer-in." .
helix:cs_achievement_level a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Achievement Level" ; skos:notation "helix/achievement-level" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__exceeds a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "exceeds" ; skos:prefLabel "Exceeds Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance exceeds the expected standard" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__meets a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "meets" ; skos:prefLabel "Meets Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance meets the expected standard" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__approaching a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "approaching" ; skos:prefLabel "Approaching Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance is approaching the expected standard" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__below a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "below" ; skos:prefLabel "Below Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance is below the expected standard" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__not_demonstrated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "not_demonstrated" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Demonstrated" ; skos:definition "The competency was not demonstrated" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__exemplary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "exemplary" ; skos:prefLabel "Exemplary" ; skos:definition "Developmental scale: exemplary attainment" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__proficient a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "proficient" ; skos:prefLabel "Proficient" ; skos:definition "Developmental scale: proficient attainment" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__developing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "developing" ; skos:prefLabel "Developing" ; skos:definition "Developmental scale: developing attainment" .
helix:cs_achievement_level__beginning a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_achievement_level ; skos:notation "beginning" ; skos:prefLabel "Beginning" ; skos:definition "Developmental scale: beginning attainment" .
helix:cs_admission_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Admission Status" ; skos:notation "helix/admission-status" .
helix:cs_admission_status__submitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "submitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Submitted" ; skos:definition "Application received by the institution" .
helix:cs_admission_status__in_review a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "in_review" ; skos:prefLabel "In Review" ; skos:definition "Application is being evaluated by admissions staff or committee" .
helix:cs_admission_status__incomplete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "incomplete" ; skos:prefLabel "Incomplete" ; skos:definition "Application is missing required materials (transcripts, test scores, essays, etc.)" .
helix:cs_admission_status__admitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "admitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Admitted" ; skos:definition "Full admission offered" .
helix:cs_admission_status__conditionally_admitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "conditionally_admitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Conditionally Admitted" ; skos:definition "Admission contingent on meeting specified conditions (e.g., final transcript, GPA threshold)" .
helix:cs_admission_status__denied a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "denied" ; skos:prefLabel "Denied" ; skos:definition "Application was not approved for admission" .
helix:cs_admission_status__waitlisted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "waitlisted" ; skos:prefLabel "Waitlisted" ; skos:definition "Applicant placed on a waiting list pending space availability" .
helix:cs_admission_status__deferred a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "deferred" ; skos:prefLabel "Deferred" ; skos:definition "Decision postponed to a future review cycle (common in early decision/action)" .
helix:cs_admission_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Application cancelled by the institution (e.g., duplicate, fraud)" .
helix:cs_admission_status__withdrawn a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_admission_status ; skos:notation "withdrawn" ; skos:prefLabel "Withdrawn" ; skos:definition "Applicant voluntarily withdrew their application" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Aid Application Status" ; skos:notation "helix/aid-application-status" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__received a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "received" ; skos:prefLabel "Received" ; skos:definition "Application/ISIR received by the institution" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__in_review a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "in_review" ; skos:prefLabel "In Review" ; skos:definition "Being reviewed by the financial aid office" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__verification_required a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "verification_required" ; skos:prefLabel "Verification Required" ; skos:definition "Selected for verification; documentation needed" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__verification_complete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "verification_complete" ; skos:prefLabel "Verification Complete" ; skos:definition "Verification finished" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__isir_correction_pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "isir_correction_pending" ; skos:prefLabel "ISIR Correction Pending" ; skos:definition "A correction has been submitted to the CPS/FPS and is pending" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__complete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "complete" ; skos:prefLabel "Complete" ; skos:definition "Application complete and ready for packaging" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__rejected a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "rejected" ; skos:prefLabel "Rejected" ; skos:definition "Application rejected (e.g., reject codes unresolved)" .
helix:cs_aid_application_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_aid_application_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Application cancelled by student or institution" .
helix:cs_asset_category a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Asset Category" ; skos:notation "helix/asset-category" .
helix:cs_asset_category__land a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "land" ; skos:prefLabel "Land" ; skos:definition "Real property owned by the institution, including land improvements that are not depreciable (grading, fill). Land is not depreciated. Includes donated land recorded at fair market value at date of gift." .
helix:cs_asset_category__buildings a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "buildings" ; skos:prefLabel "Buildings" ; skos:definition "Structures owned or capital-leased by the institution. Includes academic buildings, residence halls, athletic facilities, hospitals, parking structures. Capitalization threshold varies ($50K-$100K typical). Depreciated over 20-50 years." .
helix:cs_asset_category__building_improvements a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "building_improvements" ; skos:prefLabel "Building Improvements" ; skos:definition "Capital improvements that extend the useful life of an existing building (not routine maintenance). Examples: roof replacement, HVAC system, ADA renovations, laboratory renovations. Depreciated over 10-20 years." .
helix:cs_asset_category__equipment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "equipment" ; skos:prefLabel "Equipment" ; skos:definition "Movable assets meeting the capitalization threshold ($5,000 is the most common threshold in higher ed). Includes scientific instruments, computing equipment, vehicles, copiers, specialized machinery. Depreciated over 3-15 years depending on type." .
helix:cs_asset_category__vehicles a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "vehicles" ; skos:prefLabel "Vehicles" ; skos:definition "Institutional fleet vehicles: cars, vans, buses, utility vehicles, golf carts. May be owned or leased. Depreciated over 5-10 years. Subject to motor pool or fleet management policies." .
helix:cs_asset_category__furniture a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "furniture" ; skos:prefLabel "Furniture & Fixtures" ; skos:definition "Desks, chairs, tables, filing cabinets, shelving, lab benches. Often capitalized only as a group purchase (e.g., furnishing a new building) due to per-item cost below the threshold." .
helix:cs_asset_category__software a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "software" ; skos:prefLabel "Software" ; skos:definition "Internally developed or purchased software meeting capitalization criteria. Per GASB 51 (public) or ASC 350-40 (private), includes costs in the application development stage. Cloud computing arrangements may not qualify as capital assets post-ASU 2018-15." .
helix:cs_asset_category__leasehold_improvements a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "leasehold_improvements" ; skos:prefLabel "Leasehold Improvements" ; skos:definition "Improvements to leased space made by the institution as tenant. Depreciated over the shorter of the improvement's useful life or the remaining lease term. New lease accounting (GASB 87) affects recognition." .
helix:cs_asset_category__construction_in_progress a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "construction_in_progress" ; skos:prefLabel "Construction in Progress (CIP)" ; skos:definition "Costs accumulated for assets under construction that have not yet been placed in service. Transferred to the appropriate asset category upon completion. Not depreciated while in CIP. Reported separately on the balance sheet." .
helix:cs_asset_category__library_collections a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "library_collections" ; skos:prefLabel "Library Collections" ; skos:definition "Books, periodicals, digital resources, archives, and special collections. Institutions may capitalize (GASB allows either capitalizing or expensing). If capitalized, may be depreciated as a group using a composite method or treated as inexhaustible." .
helix:cs_asset_category__artwork_collections a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "artwork_collections" ; skos:prefLabel "Artwork & Historical Collections" ; skos:definition "Museum objects, artwork, and historical treasures meeting the definition of a collection under GASB 34 (held for public exhibition, protected, kept unencumbered, proceeds from sale used to acquire other items). May be exempt from capitalization and depreciation if meeting all criteria." .
helix:cs_asset_category__infrastructure a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_category ; skos:notation "infrastructure" ; skos:prefLabel "Infrastructure" ; skos:definition "Long-lived capital assets that are normally stationary: roads, bridges, tunnels, drainage systems, water and sewer systems, dams, lighting. Institutions may use the modified approach (maintain/preserve condition level) instead of depreciation per GASB 34." .
helix:cs_asset_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Fixed Asset Status" ; skos:notation "helix/asset-status" .
helix:cs_asset_status__active a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "active" ; skos:prefLabel "Active/In Service" ; skos:definition "Asset is in use and being depreciated according to institutional capitalization and depreciation policy. Tagged with a barcode or RFID for inventory tracking." .
helix:cs_asset_status__idle a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "idle" ; skos:prefLabel "Idle/In Storage" ; skos:definition "Asset is not currently in use but remains in institutional inventory. May be available for redeployment to another department. Depreciation continues." .
helix:cs_asset_status__under_repair a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "under_repair" ; skos:prefLabel "Under Repair/Maintenance" ; skos:definition "Asset temporarily removed from service for repair or refurbishment. Depreciation continues. If repair cost exceeds a threshold (often 50% of replacement value), may be candidate for disposal." .
helix:cs_asset_status__disposed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "disposed" ; skos:prefLabel "Disposed" ; skos:definition "Asset removed from service and disposed of through approved methods: auction, trade-in, donation, recycling, or destruction. Requires disposal authorization (surplus property process). Net book value written off. Federal grants require sponsor notification for assets over $5,000." .
helix:cs_asset_status__retired a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "retired" ; skos:prefLabel "Retired" ; skos:definition "Asset has reached end of useful life and is fully depreciated. Removed from active inventory but record retained for audit trail. Physical asset may still be in use but has no book value." .
helix:cs_asset_status__lost a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "lost" ; skos:prefLabel "Lost/Stolen" ; skos:definition "Asset cannot be located during physical inventory. Triggers investigation and insurance claim if applicable. If government-funded, may require disclosure to the sponsor. Removed from active inventory after investigation." .
helix:cs_asset_status__transferred a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "transferred" ; skos:prefLabel "Transferred" ; skos:definition "Asset transferred to another department, campus, or entity. Original department's asset account credited; receiving department debited. If transferred to a different legal entity, may constitute a disposal." .
helix:cs_asset_status__construction_in_progress a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_asset_status ; skos:notation "construction_in_progress" ; skos:prefLabel "Construction in Progress (CIP)" ; skos:definition "Asset under construction or development that has not yet been placed in service. Costs accumulated in CIP account. Not depreciated until substantially complete and placed in service. Common for building projects and major renovations." .
helix:cs_award_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Financial Aid Award Type" ; skos:notation "helix/award-type" .
helix:cs_award_type__grant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "grant" ; skos:prefLabel "Grant" ; skos:definition "Gift aid that does not need to be repaid (e.g., Pell Grant)" .
helix:cs_award_type__scholarship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "scholarship" ; skos:prefLabel "Scholarship" ; skos:definition "Merit- or criteria-based gift aid that does not need to be repaid" .
helix:cs_award_type__loan_subsidized a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "loan_subsidized" ; skos:prefLabel "Subsidized Loan" ; skos:definition "Need-based loan where the government pays interest while student is enrolled" .
helix:cs_award_type__loan_unsubsidized a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "loan_unsubsidized" ; skos:prefLabel "Unsubsidized Loan" ; skos:definition "Non-need-based loan where interest accrues from disbursement" .
helix:cs_award_type__loan_plus a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "loan_plus" ; skos:prefLabel "PLUS Loan" ; skos:definition "Federal loan for parents of dependent undergrads or graduate/professional students" .
helix:cs_award_type__loan_private a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "loan_private" ; skos:prefLabel "Private Loan" ; skos:definition "Loan from a private lender, not part of federal programs" .
helix:cs_award_type__work_study a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "work_study" ; skos:prefLabel "Work-Study" ; skos:definition "Earnings from a federally or institutionally funded part-time employment program" .
helix:cs_award_type__waiver a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "waiver" ; skos:prefLabel "Tuition Waiver" ; skos:definition "Full or partial waiver of tuition or fees" .
helix:cs_award_type__fellowship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "fellowship" ; skos:prefLabel "Fellowship" ; skos:definition "Financial support for graduate students, typically for research or academic merit" .
helix:cs_award_type__assistantship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "assistantship" ; skos:prefLabel "Assistantship" ; skos:definition "Graduate teaching or research assistantship with stipend and/or tuition remission" .
helix:cs_award_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_award_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "An award type not covered by the standard codes" .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Benefit Plan Type" ; skos:notation "helix/benefit-plan-type" .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__medical a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "medical" ; skos:prefLabel "Medical Insurance" ; skos:definition "Health insurance coverage for eligible employees and dependents. Institutions typically offer multiple plan options (PPO, HMO, HDHP). State employees may be on a state health plan." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__dental a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "dental" ; skos:prefLabel "Dental Insurance" ; skos:definition "Dental care coverage, often offered as a separate plan from medical. May include preventive, basic, and major services with annual maximums." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__vision a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "vision" ; skos:prefLabel "Vision Insurance" ; skos:definition "Vision care coverage for exams, lenses, and frames. Typically a voluntary, employee-paid benefit." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__life_insurance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "life_insurance" ; skos:prefLabel "Life Insurance" ; skos:definition "Employer-provided or voluntary life insurance. Employer-paid basic life is common (1x or 2x salary). Supplemental life available at employee cost. Amounts above $50,000 create imputed income (IRS Section 79)." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__disability_short_term a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "disability_short_term" ; skos:prefLabel "Short-Term Disability" ; skos:definition "Income replacement for temporary medical disability, typically covering 60-70% of salary for up to 26 weeks. May be employer-paid or voluntary. Coordinates with sick leave and FMLA." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__disability_long_term a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "disability_long_term" ; skos:prefLabel "Long-Term Disability" ; skos:definition "Income replacement for extended medical disability after short-term benefits exhaust. Typically covers 60% of salary until age 65 or recovery. Often employer-paid for faculty." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__retirement_403b a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "retirement_403b" ; skos:prefLabel "403(b) Retirement Plan" ; skos:definition "Tax-deferred retirement savings plan authorized under IRC Section 403(b) for employees of educational institutions and nonprofits. The higher ed equivalent of a 401(k). Common providers: TIAA, Fidelity, Vanguard." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__retirement_pension a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "retirement_pension" ; skos:prefLabel "Defined Benefit Pension" ; skos:definition "State or institutional pension plan providing retirement income based on a formula (typically years of service × final average salary × multiplier). Common at public institutions. Mandatory participation in many states." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__retirement_457b a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "retirement_457b" ; skos:prefLabel "457(b) Deferred Compensation" ; skos:definition "Supplemental retirement savings plan under IRC Section 457(b), available to governmental and certain nonprofit employees. Allows additional tax-deferred savings beyond 403(b) limits." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__tuition_waiver a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "tuition_waiver" ; skos:prefLabel "Tuition Waiver/Remission" ; skos:definition "Benefit allowing employees (and often spouses/dependents) to take courses at reduced or no cost. Graduate tuition waivers above $5,250 per year are taxable income (IRC Section 127). One of higher ed's most valued benefits." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__hsa a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "hsa" ; skos:prefLabel "Health Savings Account (HSA)" ; skos:definition "Tax-advantaged savings account paired with a High Deductible Health Plan (HDHP). Employee and/or employer contributions. Triple tax advantage: deductible contributions, tax-free growth, tax-free qualified withdrawals." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__fsa a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "fsa" ; skos:prefLabel "Flexible Spending Account (FSA)" ; skos:definition "Pre-tax account for healthcare or dependent care expenses. Use-it-or-lose-it rule applies (with limited rollover or grace period). Includes healthcare FSA and dependent care FSA." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__cobra a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "cobra" ; skos:prefLabel "COBRA Continuation Coverage" ; skos:definition "Continuation of group health benefits after a qualifying event (termination, reduction in hours). Employer must offer; employee pays full premium plus 2% admin fee. 18-36 month coverage period." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__eap a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "eap" ; skos:prefLabel "Employee Assistance Program (EAP)" ; skos:definition "Confidential counseling and referral service for personal and work-related issues. Typically covers mental health, substance abuse, financial counseling, legal assistance. Usually employer-paid, no-cost to employee." .
helix:cs_benefit_plan_type__supplemental_retirement a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_benefit_plan_type ; skos:notation "supplemental_retirement" ; skos:prefLabel "Supplemental Retirement" ; skos:definition "Additional retirement contribution by the institution beyond the base retirement plan, often provided to senior faculty and administrators as a recruitment/retention tool. May vest over a period of years." .
helix:cs_budget_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Budget Status" ; skos:notation "helix/budget-status" .
helix:cs_budget_status__proposed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "proposed" ; skos:prefLabel "Proposed/Draft" ; skos:definition "Budget is being developed. Units have submitted requests, and the budget office is compiling and reviewing. Not yet authorized for spending." .
helix:cs_budget_status__submitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "submitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Submitted for Approval" ; skos:definition "Budget submitted to the next level of approval (dean, VP, budget committee, board of trustees). Under review and may be revised before final approval." .
helix:cs_budget_status__approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved" ; skos:definition "Budget formally approved by the governing board or authorized body. Establishes legal spending authority for the fiscal year. Published to the ledger as original budget entries." .
helix:cs_budget_status__active a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "active" ; skos:prefLabel "Active" ; skos:definition "Budget is in the current fiscal year and available for spending. Transactions are being posted and checked against available budget (in commitment control systems)." .
helix:cs_budget_status__frozen a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "frozen" ; skos:prefLabel "Frozen" ; skos:definition "Budget temporarily locked, no new spending authorized except for contractual obligations and payroll. Typically imposed during mid-year budget shortfalls or pending reorganization." .
helix:cs_budget_status__closed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "closed" ; skos:prefLabel "Closed" ; skos:definition "Budget period ended. All transactions posted, accruals recorded, fiscal year closed. Budget is now historical. Remaining budget does not carry forward (except for designated carry-forward funds)." .
helix:cs_budget_status__revised a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "revised" ; skos:prefLabel "Revised" ; skos:definition "Budget has been officially amended after initial approval. A budget revision may increase, decrease, or reallocate authorized spending. Requires documented justification and appropriate approval level." .
helix:cs_budget_status__permanent_budget a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "permanent_budget" ; skos:prefLabel "Permanent/Base Budget" ; skos:definition "Ongoing budget allocation that carries forward year-to-year (e.g., salary lines, operating base). Distinguished from one-time or temporary budget allocations." .
helix:cs_budget_status__temporary_budget a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_budget_status ; skos:notation "temporary_budget" ; skos:prefLabel "Temporary/One-Time Budget" ; skos:definition "Budget allocation for a single fiscal year that does not recur. Must be re-requested annually. Examples: equipment purchases, one-time program startup costs, bridge funding." .
helix:cs_compensation_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Compensation Type" ; skos:notation "helix/compensation-type" .
helix:cs_compensation_type__base_salary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "base_salary" ; skos:prefLabel "Base Salary" ; skos:definition "Primary annual or academic-year salary for the position. For 9-month faculty, this is the academic year (AY) base; for 12-month staff, this is the fiscal year (FY) base." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__hourly a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "hourly" ; skos:prefLabel "Hourly Wage" ; skos:definition "Compensation calculated per hour worked. Used for non-exempt staff, student workers, temporary employees. Subject to FLSA minimum wage and overtime rules." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__stipend a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "stipend" ; skos:prefLabel "Stipend" ; skos:definition "Fixed payment for a specific role or responsibility, not tied to hours worked. Examples: department chair stipend, graduate assistant stipend, coaching stipend, program director stipend." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__overload a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "overload" ; skos:prefLabel "Overload Pay" ; skos:definition "Additional compensation for teaching or duties beyond the standard workload. Faculty teaching above their contractual load (e.g., 4/4 teaching 5/4) receive overload pay, typically calculated per credit hour." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__summer_pay a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "summer_pay" ; skos:prefLabel "Summer Compensation" ; skos:definition "Compensation for 9-month faculty working during summer term. Typically capped at a fraction of base salary (often 2/9 or 3/9 of AY salary). May be funded from grants, instruction, or administrative budgets." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__administrative_supplement a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "administrative_supplement" ; skos:prefLabel "Administrative Supplement" ; skos:definition "Temporary salary increase for faculty or staff taking on additional administrative duties. Examples: interim dean, accreditation coordinator, assessment director. Removed when duties end." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__acting_pay a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "acting_pay" ; skos:prefLabel "Acting Pay" ; skos:definition "Temporary pay increase for an individual formally appointed to act in a higher-level position during a vacancy or leave. Governed by institutional acting appointment policy." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__shift_differential a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "shift_differential" ; skos:prefLabel "Shift Differential" ; skos:definition "Additional compensation for working non-standard shifts (evening, night, weekend). Common for facilities, public safety, dining, and healthcare workers. Typically a percentage of base or flat hourly premium." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__on_call a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "on_call" ; skos:prefLabel "On-Call Pay" ; skos:definition "Compensation for being available to respond outside normal working hours. Common for IT, facilities, public safety, and residential life staff." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__longevity a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "longevity" ; skos:prefLabel "Longevity Pay" ; skos:definition "Additional compensation based on years of service. More common at public institutions, especially those under state pay plans. May be a flat amount or percentage per milestone (5, 10, 15 years)." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__bonus a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "bonus" ; skos:prefLabel "Bonus/Incentive" ; skos:definition "One-time or periodic payment for performance, retention, or market adjustment. Less common in higher ed than private sector but used for hard-to-fill positions, athletic coaches, and senior administrators." .
helix:cs_compensation_type__housing_allowance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_compensation_type ; skos:notation "housing_allowance" ; skos:prefLabel "Housing Allowance" ; skos:definition "Compensation provided for housing, particularly for university presidents, coaches, or employees required to live on campus (e.g., residence hall directors). May be taxable income." .
helix:cs_constituent_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Constituent Type" ; skos:notation "helix/constituent-type" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__alumnus a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "alumnus" ; skos:prefLabel "Alumnus/Alumna" ; skos:definition "Graduate or former student of the institution" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__donor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "donor" ; skos:prefLabel "Donor" ; skos:definition "Any individual who has made a gift (may overlap with other types)" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__parent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "parent" ; skos:prefLabel "Parent/Family" ; skos:definition "Parent or family member of a current or former student" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__friend a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "friend" ; skos:prefLabel "Friend of the University" ; skos:definition "Non-alumni individual with institutional affinity" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__faculty_staff a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "faculty_staff" ; skos:prefLabel "Faculty/Staff" ; skos:definition "Current or former employee" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__corporation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "corporation" ; skos:prefLabel "Corporation" ; skos:definition "Corporate entity for matching gifts or sponsorships" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__foundation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "foundation" ; skos:prefLabel "Foundation" ; skos:definition "Private or community foundation" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__organization a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "organization" ; skos:prefLabel "Organization" ; skos:definition "Non-profit, association, or other entity" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__prospect a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "prospect" ; skos:prefLabel "Prospect" ; skos:definition "Identified potential donor not yet in the giving pipeline" .
helix:cs_constituent_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_constituent_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Continuing Education Level" ; skos:notation "helix/continuing-ed-level" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__masters a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "masters" ; skos:prefLabel "Master's Degree" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a master's degree" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__doctoral a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "doctoral" ; skos:prefLabel "Doctoral Degree" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a research doctoral degree (PhD, EdD, etc.)" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__professional_jd a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "professional_jd" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional - JD" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a Juris Doctor (law)" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__professional_md a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "professional_md" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional - MD" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a Doctor of Medicine or equivalent health professional degree" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__professional_other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "professional_other" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional - Other" ; skos:definition "Pursuing another first-professional degree (DDS, PharmD, DVM, etc.)" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__second_bachelors a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "second_bachelors" ; skos:prefLabel "Second Bachelor's" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a second bachelor's degree" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__certificate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "certificate" ; skos:prefLabel "Certificate" ; skos:definition "Pursuing a post-baccalaureate certificate" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__postbaccalaureate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "postbaccalaureate" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Baccalaureate" ; skos:definition "Pursuing post-baccalaureate coursework (e.g., pre-med post-bacc)" .
helix:cs_continuing_ed_level__postdoctoral a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_continuing_ed_level ; skos:notation "postdoctoral" ; skos:prefLabel "Postdoctoral" ; skos:definition "Pursuing postdoctoral study or research" .
helix:cs_contract_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Contract Status" ; skos:notation "helix/contract-status" .
helix:cs_contract_status__draft a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "draft" ; skos:prefLabel "Draft" ; skos:definition "Contract is being drafted or assembled from templates. Terms, scope, pricing, and legal provisions under development by the requesting department and/or procurement/legal office." .
helix:cs_contract_status__negotiation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "negotiation" ; skos:prefLabel "In Negotiation" ; skos:definition "Draft contract sent to the counterparty (vendor, consultant, partner institution). Terms being negotiated. Multiple redline cycles may occur. Legal counsel reviewing risk provisions." .
helix:cs_contract_status__pending_approval a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "pending_approval" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Internal Approval" ; skos:definition "Negotiation complete; contract routed for internal signature authority. Approval levels determined by contract value and type (procurement, real estate, sponsored program, affiliation agreement)." .
helix:cs_contract_status__pending_execution a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "pending_execution" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Execution" ; skos:definition "Approved internally; awaiting counterparty signature to fully execute. Both parties must sign for the contract to be binding." .
helix:cs_contract_status__active a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "active" ; skos:prefLabel "Active/Executed" ; skos:definition "Fully executed contract in its performance period. Both parties performing obligations. Deliverables and payments being tracked. May include milestones, performance metrics, and reporting requirements." .
helix:cs_contract_status__suspended a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "suspended" ; skos:prefLabel "Suspended" ; skos:definition "Contract performance temporarily halted due to dispute, non-performance, force majeure, or administrative hold. Terms of suspension governed by the contract's suspension/termination clause." .
helix:cs_contract_status__expired a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "expired" ; skos:prefLabel "Expired" ; skos:definition "Contract has reached its end date without renewal. No further obligations except surviving provisions (indemnification, confidentiality, audit rights). Some contracts auto-renew unless notice given within a specified window." .
helix:cs_contract_status__terminated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "terminated" ; skos:prefLabel "Terminated" ; skos:definition "Contract ended before the natural expiration date, either by mutual agreement (convenience) or due to breach (cause). Termination provisions in the contract govern notice period, final payments, and transition obligations." .
helix:cs_contract_status__renewed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_contract_status ; skos:notation "renewed" ; skos:prefLabel "Renewed" ; skos:definition "Contract extended for an additional period under the same or modified terms. May be an automatic renewal or require affirmative action. Renewal terms should be documented as an amendment or new contract." .
helix:cs_course_level a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Course Level" ; skos:notation "helix/course-level" .
helix:cs_course_level__developmental a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "developmental" ; skos:prefLabel "Developmental/Remedial" ; skos:definition "Below college-level. Does not count toward degree credit." .
helix:cs_course_level__undergraduate_lower a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "undergraduate_lower" ; skos:prefLabel "Undergraduate Lower Division" ; skos:definition "100-200 level. Introductory and foundational courses." .
helix:cs_course_level__undergraduate_upper a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "undergraduate_upper" ; skos:prefLabel "Undergraduate Upper Division" ; skos:definition "300-400 level. Advanced undergraduate courses requiring prerequisites." .
helix:cs_course_level__graduate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "graduate" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduate" ; skos:definition "500-600 level (convention varies). Master's-level coursework." .
helix:cs_course_level__doctoral a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "doctoral" ; skos:prefLabel "Doctoral" ; skos:definition "700+ level. Doctoral seminars, research, dissertation hours." .
helix:cs_course_level__professional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "professional" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional" ; skos:definition "Professional program courses (law, medicine, etc.) with their own numbering conventions." .
helix:cs_course_level__non_credit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "non_credit" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Credit" ; skos:definition "Continuing education, professional development, or community courses not carrying academic credit." .
helix:cs_course_level__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_course_level ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_data_classification a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Data Classification" ; skos:notation "helix/data-classification" .
helix:cs_data_classification__public a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_data_classification ; skos:notation "public" ; skos:prefLabel "Public" ; skos:definition "Data approved for unrestricted public access (e.g., course catalog, institution name)" .
helix:cs_data_classification__internal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_data_classification ; skos:notation "internal" ; skos:prefLabel "Internal" ; skos:definition "Data intended for institutional use only (e.g., enrollment counts, section capacity)" .
helix:cs_data_classification__confidential a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_data_classification ; skos:notation "confidential" ; skos:prefLabel "Confidential" ; skos:definition "Data protected by regulation or policy (e.g., student PII, grades, financial aid). FERPA-protected data falls here at minimum." .
helix:cs_data_classification__restricted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_data_classification ; skos:notation "restricted" ; skos:prefLabel "Restricted" ; skos:definition "Highly sensitive data requiring strict access controls (e.g., SSN, health records, disciplinary records)" .
helix:cs_degree_level a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Degree Level" ; skos:notation "helix/degree-level" .
helix:cs_degree_level__certificate_undergraduate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "certificate_undergraduate" ; skos:prefLabel "Undergraduate Certificate" ; skos:definition "Sub-baccalaureate certificate (less than 1 year or 1-2 years)" .
helix:cs_degree_level__associate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "associate" ; skos:prefLabel "Associate Degree" ; skos:definition "Two-year degree (AA, AS, AAS, etc.)" .
helix:cs_degree_level__bachelors a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "bachelors" ; skos:prefLabel "Bachelor's Degree" ; skos:definition "Four-year baccalaureate degree (BA, BS, BFA, etc.)" .
helix:cs_degree_level__certificate_post_baccalaureate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "certificate_post_baccalaureate" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Baccalaureate Certificate" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_degree_level__masters a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "masters" ; skos:prefLabel "Master's Degree" ; skos:definition "Graduate-level master's degree (MA, MS, MBA, MFA, etc.)" .
helix:cs_degree_level__certificate_post_masters a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "certificate_post_masters" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Master's Certificate" ; skos:definition "e.g., Education Specialist (EdS)" .
helix:cs_degree_level__doctoral_research a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "doctoral_research" ; skos:prefLabel "Doctoral Degree - Research/Scholarship" ; skos:definition "PhD, EdD (research-focused), DMA, etc." .
helix:cs_degree_level__doctoral_professional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "doctoral_professional" ; skos:prefLabel "Doctoral Degree - Professional Practice" ; skos:definition "MD, JD, DDS, PharmD, DPT, etc." .
helix:cs_degree_level__professional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "professional" ; skos:prefLabel "First Professional Degree" ; skos:definition "Legacy IPEDS category. Being phased into doctoral_professional." .
helix:cs_degree_level__non_degree a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "non_degree" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Degree / Non-Credit" ; skos:definition "Enrollment without pursuit of a formal credential" .
helix:cs_degree_level__micro_credential a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "micro_credential" ; skos:prefLabel "Micro-Credential / Badge" ; skos:definition "Short-form credential, often competency-based or industry-aligned" .
helix:cs_degree_level__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_degree_level ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Delivery Mode" ; skos:notation "helix/delivery-mode" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__in_person a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "in_person" ; skos:prefLabel "In Person" ; skos:definition "Traditional face-to-face instruction in a physical classroom" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__online_synchronous a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "online_synchronous" ; skos:prefLabel "Online Synchronous" ; skos:definition "Online instruction with scheduled real-time meetings (via Zoom, Teams, etc.)" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__online_asynchronous a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "online_asynchronous" ; skos:prefLabel "Online Asynchronous" ; skos:definition "Online instruction with no scheduled meeting times. Students access materials on their own schedule." .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__hybrid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "hybrid" ; skos:prefLabel "Hybrid" ; skos:definition "Mix of in-person and online components, with reduced in-person seat time" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__hyflex a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "hyflex" ; skos:prefLabel "HyFlex" ; skos:definition "Students choose per-session whether to attend in person or online synchronously" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__competency_based a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "competency_based" ; skos:prefLabel "Competency-Based" ; skos:definition "Progress based on demonstrated mastery rather than seat time" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__correspondence a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "correspondence" ; skos:prefLabel "Correspondence" ; skos:definition "Self-paced study via mailed or digital materials with limited instructor interaction" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__clinical a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "clinical" ; skos:prefLabel "Clinical/Practicum" ; skos:definition "Supervised hands-on experience in a clinical, field, or professional setting" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__internship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "internship" ; skos:prefLabel "Internship/Co-op" ; skos:definition "Work-integrated learning in a professional setting" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__independent_study a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "independent_study" ; skos:prefLabel "Independent Study" ; skos:definition "Student-directed study under faculty supervision" .
helix:cs_delivery_mode__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_delivery_mode ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_dependency_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Dependency Status" ; skos:notation "helix/dependency-status" .
helix:cs_dependency_status__dependent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_dependency_status ; skos:notation "dependent" ; skos:prefLabel "Dependent" ; skos:definition "Student must report parent information" .
helix:cs_dependency_status__independent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_dependency_status ; skos:notation "independent" ; skos:prefLabel "Independent" ; skos:definition "Student meets an independence criterion; parent info not required" .
helix:cs_dependency_status__dependency_override_approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_dependency_status ; skos:notation "dependency_override_approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Dependency Override Approved" ; skos:definition "FAA approved an override to independent" .
helix:cs_dependency_status__provisional_independent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_dependency_status ; skos:notation "provisional_independent" ; skos:prefLabel "Provisional Independent" ; skos:definition "Provisionally independent pending documentation (e.g., homeless/unaccompanied youth)" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Disbursement Status" ; skos:notation "helix/disbursement-status" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__scheduled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "scheduled" ; skos:prefLabel "Scheduled" ; skos:definition "Disbursement scheduled for a future date" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending" ; skos:definition "Pending prerequisites (enrollment, MPN, etc.)" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__held a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "held" ; skos:prefLabel "Held" ; skos:definition "Held due to an outstanding requirement or hold" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__disbursed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "disbursed" ; skos:prefLabel "Disbursed" ; skos:definition "Fully disbursed to the student account" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__partially_disbursed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "partially_disbursed" ; skos:prefLabel "Partially Disbursed" ; skos:definition "Partially disbursed" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Disbursement cancelled" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__returned a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "returned" ; skos:prefLabel "Returned" ; skos:definition "Disbursed funds returned" .
helix:cs_disbursement_status__refunded a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_disbursement_status ; skos:notation "refunded" ; skos:prefLabel "Refunded" ; skos:definition "Credit balance refunded to the student" .
helix:cs_donor_segment a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Donor Segment" ; skos:notation "helix/donor-segment" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__non_donor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "non_donor" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Donor" ; skos:definition "Constituent has never made a gift" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__first_time a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "first_time" ; skos:prefLabel "First-Time Donor" ; skos:definition "Made their first gift in the current fiscal year" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__renewing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "renewing" ; skos:prefLabel "Renewing Donor" ; skos:definition "Gave last year and gave again this year at the same level" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__upgrading a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "upgrading" ; skos:prefLabel "Upgrading Donor" ; skos:definition "Gave last year and increased their giving this year" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__downgrading a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "downgrading" ; skos:prefLabel "Downgrading Donor" ; skos:definition "Gave last year but decreased their giving this year" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__loyal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "loyal" ; skos:prefLabel "Loyal/Consecutive Donor" ; skos:definition "Has given consecutively for 3+ years" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__lapsed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "lapsed" ; skos:prefLabel "Lapsed Donor" ; skos:definition "Previously gave but has not given in the last 1-2 fiscal years" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__deep_lapsed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "deep_lapsed" ; skos:prefLabel "Deep Lapsed Donor" ; skos:definition "Previously gave but has not given in 3+ fiscal years" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__major a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "major" ; skos:prefLabel "Major Donor" ; skos:definition "Cumulative or single-gift giving at the institution's major gift threshold (typically $25K-$100K+)" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__planned_giving a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "planned_giving" ; skos:prefLabel "Planned Giving Donor" ; skos:definition "Has documented a planned gift (bequest, trust, beneficiary designation)" .
helix:cs_donor_segment__recaptured a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_donor_segment ; skos:notation "recaptured" ; skos:prefLabel "Recaptured Donor" ; skos:definition "Was lapsed but made a new gift this year" .
helix:cs_eeo_category a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "EEO/IPEDS Occupational Category" ; skos:notation "helix/eeo-category" .
helix:cs_eeo_category__executive_admin a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "executive_admin" ; skos:prefLabel "Executive/Administrative/Managerial" ; skos:definition "Senior institutional officers with significant management responsibilities: president, provost, vice presidents, deans, directors. IPEDS new categories map this to: Management Occupations (SOC 11-0000)." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__faculty a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "faculty" ; skos:prefLabel "Faculty" ; skos:definition "Persons with academic rank (professor, associate professor, assistant professor, instructor, lecturer) whose primary assignment is instruction, research, or public service. Includes tenure-track, tenured, and non-tenure-track faculty reported in IPEDS." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__professional_nonfaculty a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "professional_nonfaculty" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional Non-Faculty" ; skos:definition "Non-faculty employees in positions requiring a bachelor's degree or higher. Includes advisors, counselors, librarians, IT professionals, accountants, HR specialists, student affairs professionals, coaches, and research staff without faculty rank." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__clerical_secretarial a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "clerical_secretarial" ; skos:prefLabel "Clerical/Secretarial" ; skos:definition "Support staff in office and administrative roles: administrative assistants, office managers, data entry, receptionists, records clerks. Aligns with IPEDS Office and Administrative Support Occupations (SOC 43-0000)." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__technical_paraprofessional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "technical_paraprofessional" ; skos:prefLabel "Technical/Paraprofessional" ; skos:definition "Workers in technical roles typically requiring specialized training or an associate degree: lab technicians, IT support, library paraprofessionals, medical technicians, engineering technicians. Aligns with IPEDS Healthcare Practitioners, Computer/Engineering/Science Technicians." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__skilled_crafts a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "skilled_crafts" ; skos:prefLabel "Skilled Crafts" ; skos:definition "Workers in trades requiring apprenticeship or vocational training: electricians, plumbers, HVAC technicians, carpenters, painters, groundskeepers. Aligns with IPEDS Construction, Installation/Maintenance/Repair Occupations." .
helix:cs_eeo_category__service_maintenance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_eeo_category ; skos:notation "service_maintenance" ; skos:prefLabel "Service/Maintenance" ; skos:definition "Workers in building maintenance, custodial, food service, public safety, transportation, and similar operational roles. Aligns with IPEDS Service Occupations (SOC 31-0000, 33-0000, 35-0000, 37-0000, 39-0000, 53-0000)." .
helix:cs_employment_relation a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Employment Relation to Major" ; skos:notation "helix/employment-relation" .
helix:cs_employment_relation__directly_related a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_relation ; skos:notation "directly_related" ; skos:prefLabel "Directly Related" ; skos:definition "The position is directly in the graduate's field of study" .
helix:cs_employment_relation__somewhat_related a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_relation ; skos:notation "somewhat_related" ; skos:prefLabel "Somewhat Related" ; skos:definition "The position is partially or tangentially related to the field of study" .
helix:cs_employment_relation__not_related a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_relation ; skos:notation "not_related" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Related" ; skos:definition "The position is unrelated to the field of study" .
helix:cs_employment_relation__not_applicable a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_relation ; skos:notation "not_applicable" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Applicable" ; skos:definition "Relation to major is not applicable or not reported" .
helix:cs_employment_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Employment Status" ; skos:notation "helix/employment-status" .
helix:cs_employment_status__active a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "active" ; skos:prefLabel "Active" ; skos:definition "Currently employed and in active pay status. Includes workers on regular schedule, reduced schedule, or modified duties." .
helix:cs_employment_status__inactive a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "inactive" ; skos:prefLabel "Inactive" ; skos:definition "Employment record exists but individual is not currently in active pay status. Used for seasonal workers between terms or workers awaiting administrative processing." .
helix:cs_employment_status__leave_of_absence a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "leave_of_absence" ; skos:prefLabel "Leave of Absence" ; skos:definition "Approved absence from duties with employment relationship maintained. Includes FMLA, personal leave, medical leave, military leave, sabbatical. Benefits continuation varies by leave type and institutional policy." .
helix:cs_employment_status__terminated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "terminated" ; skos:prefLabel "Terminated" ; skos:definition "Employment relationship ended, either voluntarily (resignation) or involuntarily (dismissal, layoff, reduction in force). Triggers COBRA notification, final pay requirements, and exit processing." .
helix:cs_employment_status__retired a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "retired" ; skos:prefLabel "Retired" ; skos:definition "Employment ended through formal retirement. May trigger retiree benefits (if offered), emeritus consideration (for faculty), and pension/403(b) distribution eligibility." .
helix:cs_employment_status__suspended a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "suspended" ; skos:prefLabel "Suspended" ; skos:definition "Employment relationship maintained but worker is temporarily removed from duties, with or without pay. Typically pending investigation or disciplinary action." .
helix:cs_employment_status__deceased a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "deceased" ; skos:prefLabel "Deceased" ; skos:definition "Worker is deceased. Triggers survivor benefit processing, final pay to estate, life insurance claim, and tax document generation (W-2 to estate/beneficiary)." .
helix:cs_employment_status__furloughed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_status ; skos:notation "furloughed" ; skos:prefLabel "Furloughed" ; skos:definition "Temporary unpaid leave initiated by the institution, typically due to budget constraints. Employment relationship maintained; worker retains benefits eligibility in most cases." .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Student Employment Type (Aid)" ; skos:notation "helix/employment-type-aid" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__federal_work_study a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "federal_work_study" ; skos:prefLabel "Federal Work-Study" ; skos:definition "FWS-funded employment" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__institutional_work_study a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "institutional_work_study" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional Work-Study" ; skos:definition "Institution-funded work-study" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__graduate_assistantship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "graduate_assistantship" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduate Assistantship" ; skos:definition "Graduate assistantship (GA)" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__teaching_assistantship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "teaching_assistantship" ; skos:prefLabel "Teaching Assistantship" ; skos:definition "Teaching assistantship (TA)" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__research_assistantship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "research_assistantship" ; skos:prefLabel "Research Assistantship" ; skos:definition "Research assistantship (RA)" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__fellowship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "fellowship" ; skos:prefLabel "Fellowship" ; skos:definition "Fellowship-supported position" .
helix:cs_employment_type_aid__off_campus_community_service a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_employment_type_aid ; skos:notation "off_campus_community_service" ; skos:prefLabel "Off-Campus Community Service" ; skos:definition "FWS community-service placement off campus" .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Enrollment Funnel Stage" ; skos:notation "helix/enrollment-funnel-stage" .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__suspect a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "suspect" ; skos:prefLabel "Suspect" ; skos:definition "Name purchased or scraped from College Board, ACT, NRCCUA, or other list source. No interaction yet." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__inquiry a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "inquiry" ; skos:prefLabel "Inquiry" ; skos:definition "Student has initiated contact: RFI form, campus visit request, email, test score send, or fair card." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__applicant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "applicant" ; skos:prefLabel "Applicant" ; skos:definition "Student has submitted an application for admission." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__admitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "admitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Admitted" ; skos:definition "Application approved. Admit letter/package sent." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__confirmed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "confirmed" ; skos:prefLabel "Confirmed/Deposited" ; skos:definition "Student has paid enrollment deposit, confirming intent to enroll." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__registered a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "registered" ; skos:prefLabel "Registered" ; skos:definition "Student has completed orientation and/or registered for courses." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__enrolled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "enrolled" ; skos:prefLabel "Enrolled" ; skos:definition "Student attended first day/census. Officially counted in enrollment." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__melted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "melted" ; skos:prefLabel "Melted (Summer Melt)" ; skos:definition "Student confirmed/deposited but did not register or attend. Lost between confirmation and enrollment." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__denied a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "denied" ; skos:prefLabel "Denied" ; skos:definition "Application was not approved." .
helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage__withdrawn a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_funnel_stage ; skos:notation "withdrawn" ; skos:prefLabel "Withdrawn" ; skos:definition "Student withdrew application or rescinded deposit before enrollment." .
helix:cs_enrollment_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Enrollment Status" ; skos:notation "helix/enrollment-status" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__registered a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "registered" ; skos:prefLabel "Registered" ; skos:definition "Student has registered but the term has not started or census has not passed" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__waitlisted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "waitlisted" ; skos:prefLabel "Waitlisted" ; skos:definition "Student is on a waitlist for the section" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__enrolled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "enrolled" ; skos:prefLabel "Enrolled" ; skos:definition "Student is confirmed enrolled (post-census or post-start)" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__dropped a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "dropped" ; skos:prefLabel "Dropped" ; skos:definition "Student dropped the course before the institution's drop deadline (typically no record on transcript)" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__withdrawn a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "withdrawn" ; skos:prefLabel "Withdrawn" ; skos:definition "Student withdrew after the drop deadline (typically a 'W' on transcript)" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__completed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "completed" ; skos:prefLabel "Completed" ; skos:definition "Student completed the course and received a final grade" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__incomplete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "incomplete" ; skos:prefLabel "Incomplete" ; skos:definition "Student received an incomplete grade with a deadline for completion" .
helix:cs_enrollment_status__auditing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_enrollment_status ; skos:notation "auditing" ; skos:prefLabel "Auditing" ; skos:definition "Student is attending the course without receiving credit or a grade" .
helix:cs_ethnicity a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Ethnicity/Race" ; skos:notation "helix/ethnicity" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__hispanic_latino a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "hispanic_latino" ; skos:prefLabel "Hispanic or Latino" ; skos:definition "A person of Cuban, Mexican, Puerto Rican, South or Central American, or other Spanish culture or origin, regardless of race" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__american_indian_alaska_native a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "american_indian_alaska_native" ; skos:prefLabel "American Indian or Alaska Native" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__asian a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "asian" ; skos:prefLabel "Asian" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__black_african_american a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "black_african_american" ; skos:prefLabel "Black or African American" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__native_hawaiian_pacific_islander a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "native_hawaiian_pacific_islander" ; skos:prefLabel "Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__white a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "white" ; skos:prefLabel "White" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__two_or_more a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "two_or_more" ; skos:prefLabel "Two or More Races" ; skos:definition "Derived category for IPEDS reporting. Calculated when multiple race codes are selected." .
helix:cs_ethnicity__nonresident_alien a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "nonresident_alien" ; skos:prefLabel "Nonresident Alien" ; skos:definition "IPEDS category for international students on non-immigrant visas. NOT a race/ethnicity; used as an IPEDS reporting overlay." .
helix:cs_ethnicity__unknown a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "unknown" ; skos:prefLabel "Race/Ethnicity Unknown" ; skos:definition "Person declined to report or data is not available" .
helix:cs_ethnicity__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_ethnicity ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "A category not captured above. Document in institution or country-specific profile." .
helix:cs_expense_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Expense Report Status" ; skos:notation "helix/expense-status" .
helix:cs_expense_status__draft a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "draft" ; skos:prefLabel "Draft" ; skos:definition "Expense report started but not yet submitted. Employee is adding receipts, coding expenses to chartfields, and calculating mileage or per diem amounts." .
helix:cs_expense_status__submitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "submitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Submitted" ; skos:definition "Expense report submitted for approval. Routing to the appropriate approver(s) based on institutional travel policy and delegation of authority." .
helix:cs_expense_status__pending_approval a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "pending_approval" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Approval" ; skos:definition "Under review by one or more approvers. May require department head, PI (for grant-funded travel), and/or dean approval depending on dollar amount and funding source." .
helix:cs_expense_status__approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved" ; skos:definition "All required approvals obtained. Routed to accounts payable/travel office for audit and payment processing." .
helix:cs_expense_status__paid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "paid" ; skos:prefLabel "Paid/Reimbursed" ; skos:definition "Reimbursement issued to the employee via direct deposit or check. Typically processed within 5-10 business days of final approval. Grant-funded travel may take longer due to additional compliance review." .
helix:cs_expense_status__returned a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "returned" ; skos:prefLabel "Returned for Correction" ; skos:definition "Report sent back to the submitter due to issues: missing receipts, incorrect account coding, policy violations (exceeded per diem, unauthorized expenses), or missing pre-trip authorization." .
helix:cs_expense_status__denied a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "denied" ; skos:prefLabel "Denied" ; skos:definition "Expense report rejected. Common reasons: expense not allowable per policy, insufficient documentation, travel not pre-approved, exceeds budget authority, or retroactive request beyond the submission deadline (typically 30-60 days)." .
helix:cs_expense_status__under_audit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_expense_status ; skos:notation "under_audit" ; skos:prefLabel "Under Audit" ; skos:definition "Report flagged for detailed review by the travel office or internal audit. May be random selection, high-dollar threshold, or triggered by anomaly detection. Employee may need to provide additional documentation." .
helix:cs_experiential_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Experiential Learning Type" ; skos:notation "helix/experiential-type" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__internship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "internship" ; skos:prefLabel "Internship" ; skos:definition "Supervised professional work experience, often for academic credit" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__co_op a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "co_op" ; skos:prefLabel "Cooperative Education (Co-op)" ; skos:definition "Structured alternation of academic study and full-time paid employment" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__practicum a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "practicum" ; skos:prefLabel "Practicum" ; skos:definition "Supervised practical application of coursework in a professional setting" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__clinical_rotation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "clinical_rotation" ; skos:prefLabel "Clinical Rotation" ; skos:definition "Supervised clinical experience in health-professions programs" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__student_teaching a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "student_teaching" ; skos:prefLabel "Student Teaching" ; skos:definition "Supervised classroom teaching experience for education majors" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__undergraduate_research a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "undergraduate_research" ; skos:prefLabel "Undergraduate Research" ; skos:definition "Mentored scholarly or creative research" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__service_learning a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "service_learning" ; skos:prefLabel "Service Learning" ; skos:definition "Community service integrated with academic instruction and reflection" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__field_experience a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "field_experience" ; skos:prefLabel "Field Experience" ; skos:definition "Learning in a real-world field setting" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__externship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "externship" ; skos:prefLabel "Externship" ; skos:definition "Short-term job shadowing or observational experience" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__apprenticeship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "apprenticeship" ; skos:prefLabel "Apprenticeship" ; skos:definition "Structured earn-and-learn program combining work and instruction" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__capstone_project a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "capstone_project" ; skos:prefLabel "Capstone Project" ; skos:definition "Culminating integrative project or experience" .
helix:cs_experiential_type__study_abroad a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_experiential_type ; skos:notation "study_abroad" ; skos:prefLabel "Study Abroad" ; skos:definition "Academic study in another country" .
helix:cs_faculty_rank a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Faculty Rank" ; skos:notation "helix/faculty-rank" .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__instructor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "instructor" ; skos:prefLabel "Instructor" ; skos:definition "Entry-level teaching appointment, typically requiring a master's degree. Usually non-tenure-track. May be full-time or part-time. Some institutions use this rank for ABD (all but dissertation) candidates." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__lecturer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "lecturer" ; skos:prefLabel "Lecturer" ; skos:definition "Teaching-focused appointment, typically non-tenure-track. May be full-time with renewable multi-year contracts. Some institutions have a lecturer promotion track (Lecturer → Senior Lecturer → Principal Lecturer/Teaching Professor)." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__senior_lecturer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "senior_lecturer" ; skos:prefLabel "Senior Lecturer" ; skos:definition "Promoted teaching-focused rank above Lecturer. Recognizes sustained excellence in teaching and service. May carry additional responsibilities such as curriculum coordination or mentoring." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__assistant_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "assistant_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Assistant Professor" ; skos:definition "First rank on the tenure track at most institutions. Typically a 6-year probationary period before tenure review. Expected to develop a research/scholarly agenda, establish a teaching record, and demonstrate service." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__associate_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "associate_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Associate Professor" ; skos:definition "Awarded upon successful tenure review (at most institutions, tenure and promotion to Associate are simultaneous). Demonstrates sustained scholarly productivity, teaching effectiveness, and institutional service." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__full_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "full_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Professor" ; skos:definition "Highest standard rank, awarded upon promotion from Associate Professor. Demonstrates national/international distinction in scholarship, excellence in teaching, and significant service/leadership. No fixed timeline; many remain Associate for career." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__distinguished_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "distinguished_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Distinguished Professor" ; skos:definition "Honorary or endowed rank above Professor, recognizing exceptional career achievement. Often carries a named title (e.g., 'University Distinguished Professor,' 'Regents Professor'). May include an endowed salary supplement." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__university_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "university_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "University Professor" ; skos:definition "Institutional-level appointment transcending departmental boundaries. Recognizes scholars whose work spans disciplines. Reports to provost rather than a department chair. Rare and prestigious." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__emeritus_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "emeritus_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Emeritus Professor" ; skos:definition "Honorary title granted to retired faculty in recognition of distinguished service. Conferred by the governing board on recommendation of the department and provost. Retains certain privileges but is not actively employed." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__clinical_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "clinical_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Clinical Professor" ; skos:definition "Non-tenure-track rank for faculty primarily engaged in clinical teaching, supervision, or professional practice. Common in health sciences, law, education, and business. May have its own promotion track (Clinical Assistant → Clinical Associate → Clinical Full)." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__research_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "research_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Research Professor" ; skos:definition "Non-tenure-track rank for faculty primarily funded by external grants/contracts. Expected to be substantially (often 80-100%) externally funded. May have its own promotion track. Teaching is typically minimal or by choice." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__professor_of_practice a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "professor_of_practice" ; skos:prefLabel "Professor of Practice" ; skos:definition "Non-tenure-track rank for individuals with significant professional experience outside academia who bring practitioner expertise to teaching. Common in business, engineering, law, and public policy. Terminal degree not always required." .
helix:cs_faculty_rank__visiting_professor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_faculty_rank ; skos:notation "visiting_professor" ; skos:prefLabel "Visiting Professor" ; skos:definition "Temporary appointment (typically 1-2 years) for a faculty member from another institution or a scholar-in-residence. Rank mirrors the visitor's home rank or the level of the appointment." .
helix:cs_first_destination_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "First-Destination Status" ; skos:notation "helix/first-destination-status" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__employed_full_time a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "employed_full_time" ; skos:prefLabel "Employed Full-Time" ; skos:definition "Working in a full-time paid position (typically 30+ hours/week)" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__employed_part_time a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "employed_part_time" ; skos:prefLabel "Employed Part-Time" ; skos:definition "Working in a part-time paid position" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__continuing_education a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "continuing_education" ; skos:prefLabel "Continuing Education" ; skos:definition "Enrolled in a program of continuing/further education" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__military_service a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "military_service" ; skos:prefLabel "Military Service" ; skos:definition "Serving in the armed forces" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__volunteer_service a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "volunteer_service" ; skos:prefLabel "Volunteer/Service Program" ; skos:definition "Participating in a volunteer or service program (e.g., Peace Corps, AmeriCorps)" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__seeking_employment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "seeking_employment" ; skos:prefLabel "Seeking Employment" ; skos:definition "Actively seeking employment, not yet employed" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__seeking_continuing_education a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "seeking_continuing_education" ; skos:prefLabel "Seeking Continuing Education" ; skos:definition "Actively seeking to enroll in further education" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__not_seeking a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "not_seeking" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Seeking" ; skos:definition "Not seeking employment or continuing education (by choice)" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__self_employed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "self_employed" ; skos:prefLabel "Self-Employed" ; skos:definition "Working in a self-owned business or practice" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__freelance_contract a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "freelance_contract" ; skos:prefLabel "Freelance/Contract" ; skos:definition "Engaged in freelance or contract work" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__postgrad_fellowship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "postgrad_fellowship" ; skos:prefLabel "Postgraduate Fellowship" ; skos:definition "Participating in a postgraduate fellowship or internship" .
helix:cs_first_destination_status__unknown a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_first_destination_status ; skos:notation "unknown" ; skos:prefLabel "Unknown" ; skos:definition "Outcome unknown; no reasonable and verifiable information available (excluded from knowledge rate)" .
helix:cs_flsa_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "FLSA Status" ; skos:notation "helix/flsa-status" .
helix:cs_flsa_status__exempt a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_flsa_status ; skos:notation "exempt" ; skos:prefLabel "Exempt" ; skos:definition "Employee exempt from FLSA overtime provisions. Must meet both salary threshold ($35,568/year as of 2024 DOL rule, subject to judicial review) and duties test (executive, administrative, professional, computer, or outside sales exemption). Most faculty, administrators, and professional staff are exempt." .
helix:cs_flsa_status__non_exempt a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_flsa_status ; skos:notation "non_exempt" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Exempt" ; skos:definition "Employee entitled to FLSA overtime (1.5x regular rate for hours over 40 per workweek). Must track hours worked. Includes most clerical, technical, skilled trades, and service/maintenance workers. Student workers are typically non-exempt but may be FICA-exempt." .
helix:cs_flsa_status__exempt_teaching a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_flsa_status ; skos:notation "exempt_teaching" ; skos:prefLabel "Exempt, Teaching Professional" ; skos:definition "Faculty and instructors meeting the learned professional exemption for teaching. No salary threshold required for bona fide teachers. Primary duty must be teaching, tutoring, instructing, or lecturing." .
helix:cs_fund_source a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Aid Fund Source" ; skos:notation "helix/fund-source" .
helix:cs_fund_source__federal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "federal" ; skos:prefLabel "Federal" ; skos:definition "Federal Title IV or other federal source" .
helix:cs_fund_source__state a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "state" ; skos:prefLabel "State" ; skos:definition "State grant/scholarship agency" .
helix:cs_fund_source__institutional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "institutional" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional" ; skos:definition "Institution's own funds" .
helix:cs_fund_source__private a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "private" ; skos:prefLabel "Private" ; skos:definition "Private/external scholarship or donor" .
helix:cs_fund_source__employer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "employer" ; skos:prefLabel "Employer" ; skos:definition "Employer tuition benefit or sponsorship" .
helix:cs_fund_source__tribal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "tribal" ; skos:prefLabel "Tribal" ; skos:definition "Tribal nation education funding" .
helix:cs_fund_source__foreign_government a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_source ; skos:notation "foreign_government" ; skos:prefLabel "Foreign Government" ; skos:definition "Foreign government sponsorship" .
helix:cs_fund_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Fund Type" ; skos:notation "helix/fund-type" .
helix:cs_fund_type__unrestricted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "unrestricted" ; skos:prefLabel "Unrestricted Operating" ; skos:definition "General operating funds with no externally imposed restrictions on use. Funded primarily by tuition, state appropriations (public), and unrestricted gifts. The institution's primary discretionary resource pool." .
helix:cs_fund_type__temporarily_restricted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "temporarily_restricted" ; skos:prefLabel "Temporarily Restricted" ; skos:definition "Funds restricted by the donor or grantor for a specific purpose or time period. Restriction is satisfied when the purpose is fulfilled or the time period elapses. FASB ASC 958 (private institutions) terminology; GASB uses 'restricted, expendable.'" .
helix:cs_fund_type__permanently_restricted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "permanently_restricted" ; skos:prefLabel "Permanently Restricted (Endowment)" ; skos:definition "Funds where the donor has stipulated that the principal must be maintained in perpetuity. Only the investment return (subject to spending policy) may be used, and typically only for the donor's designated purpose. FASB ASC 958 terminology; GASB uses 'restricted, nonexpendable.'" .
helix:cs_fund_type__endowment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "endowment" ; skos:prefLabel "True Endowment" ; skos:definition "Donor-restricted fund where the corpus is permanently invested and cannot be spent. Income distributed per the institution's spending policy (typically 4-5% of trailing average market value). Subject to UPMIFA (Uniform Prudent Management of Institutional Funds Act)." .
helix:cs_fund_type__quasi_endowment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "quasi_endowment" ; skos:prefLabel "Quasi-Endowment (Board-Designated)" ; skos:definition "Funds functioning as endowment at the discretion of the governing board, but without a donor restriction requiring permanent investment. The board may choose to invade the principal. Reported as unrestricted in financial statements." .
helix:cs_fund_type__agency a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "agency" ; skos:prefLabel "Agency Fund" ; skos:definition "Funds held by the institution as custodian or fiscal agent for others (student organizations, external groups). The institution has no equity; assets equal liabilities. Common for student activity fees collected and disbursed." .
helix:cs_fund_type__loan a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "loan" ; skos:prefLabel "Loan Fund" ; skos:definition "Funds available for student or employee loans. Includes federal revolving loan programs (Perkins, now winding down) and institutional loan programs. Repayments recirculate into the fund." .
helix:cs_fund_type__plant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "plant" ; skos:prefLabel "Plant Fund" ; skos:definition "Funds used for acquisition, renewal, replacement, and retirement of institutional physical plant (buildings, equipment, infrastructure). Includes unexpended plant, renewals and replacements, retirement of indebtedness, and investment in plant sub-funds." .
helix:cs_fund_type__auxiliary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "auxiliary" ; skos:prefLabel "Auxiliary Enterprise Fund" ; skos:definition "Self-supporting operations that provide goods/services primarily to students, faculty, or staff: housing, dining, bookstore, parking, athletics (at some institutions), student health, recreation. Revenue should cover costs including debt service." .
helix:cs_fund_type__grant_sponsored a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "grant_sponsored" ; skos:prefLabel "Grant/Sponsored Program Fund" ; skos:definition "Funds from external sponsors (federal, state, foundation, corporate) for specific research, training, or service activities. Subject to the terms of the award and OMB Uniform Guidance (2 CFR 200). Each award typically has its own fund or project code." .
helix:cs_fund_type__designated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "designated" ; skos:prefLabel "Designated/Board-Restricted" ; skos:definition "Unrestricted funds that the institution's leadership has internally designated for a specific purpose (e.g., strategic initiative fund, deferred maintenance fund, rainy day reserve). Can be undesignated by the same authority that designated them." .
helix:cs_fund_type__current_restricted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_fund_type ; skos:notation "current_restricted" ; skos:prefLabel "Current Restricted (Non-Endowment)" ; skos:definition "Restricted funds that are expendable for a specific purpose in the current or near-term period. Examples: scholarships restricted by the donor to a specific major, gifts restricted to a specific building project. Distinguished from endowment income which is also restricted but perpetual." .
helix:cs_gender_identity a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Gender Identity" ; skos:notation "helix/gender-identity" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__man a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "man" ; skos:prefLabel "Man" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__woman a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "woman" ; skos:prefLabel "Woman" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__nonbinary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "nonbinary" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Binary" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__transgender_man a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "transgender_man" ; skos:prefLabel "Transgender Man" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__transgender_woman a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "transgender_woman" ; skos:prefLabel "Transgender Woman" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__genderqueer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "genderqueer" ; skos:prefLabel "Genderqueer/Gender Non-Conforming" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__two_spirit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "two_spirit" ; skos:prefLabel "Two-Spirit" ; skos:definition "Indigenous identity. Include only when culturally appropriate." .
helix:cs_gender_identity__prefer_not_to_say a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "prefer_not_to_say" ; skos:prefLabel "Prefer Not to Say" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__not_listed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "not_listed" ; skos:prefLabel "A Gender Not Listed Here" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender_identity__unknown a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender_identity ; skos:notation "unknown" ; skos:prefLabel "Unknown" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Gender" ; skos:notation "helix/gender" .
helix:cs_gender__male a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender ; skos:notation "male" ; skos:prefLabel "Male" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender__female a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender ; skos:notation "female" ; skos:prefLabel "Female" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_gender__nonbinary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender ; skos:notation "nonbinary" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Binary" ; skos:definition "Legal gender is non-binary (recognized in some jurisdictions)" .
helix:cs_gender__unknown a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender ; skos:notation "unknown" ; skos:prefLabel "Unknown" ; skos:definition "Gender is not known or not disclosed" .
helix:cs_gender__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gender ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "A gender not captured by the above codes. Document in extensions." .
helix:cs_gift_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Gift Type" ; skos:notation "helix/gift-type" .
helix:cs_gift_type__outright_gift a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "outright_gift" ; skos:prefLabel "Outright Gift" ; skos:definition "Immediate, completed gift of cash or equivalents" .
helix:cs_gift_type__pledge a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "pledge" ; skos:prefLabel "Pledge" ; skos:definition "Commitment to give a specified amount over a defined period" .
helix:cs_gift_type__pledge_payment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "pledge_payment" ; skos:prefLabel "Pledge Payment" ; skos:definition "Payment toward a previously made pledge" .
helix:cs_gift_type__matching_gift a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "matching_gift" ; skos:prefLabel "Matching Gift" ; skos:definition "Corporate employer match of an employee's gift" .
helix:cs_gift_type__planned_gift a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "planned_gift" ; skos:prefLabel "Planned Gift" ; skos:definition "Deferred gift through estate/financial planning (trust, annuity, will)" .
helix:cs_gift_type__bequest a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "bequest" ; skos:prefLabel "Bequest" ; skos:definition "Gift received from a deceased donor's estate" .
helix:cs_gift_type__in_kind a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "in_kind" ; skos:prefLabel "In-Kind Gift" ; skos:definition "Non-cash gift of goods, services, or property" .
helix:cs_gift_type__stock_transfer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "stock_transfer" ; skos:prefLabel "Stock/Securities Transfer" ; skos:definition "Gift of publicly traded or private securities" .
helix:cs_gift_type__real_property a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "real_property" ; skos:prefLabel "Real Property" ; skos:definition "Gift of real estate" .
helix:cs_gift_type__qcd a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "qcd" ; skos:prefLabel "Qualified Charitable Distribution" ; skos:definition "Direct transfer from IRA to institution (age 70½+)" .
helix:cs_gift_type__daf a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "daf" ; skos:prefLabel "Donor Advised Fund" ; skos:definition "Grant from a donor advised fund (Fidelity Charitable, Schwab, etc.)" .
helix:cs_gift_type__corporate_grant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "corporate_grant" ; skos:prefLabel "Corporate Grant" ; skos:definition "Grant from a corporation (distinct from matching gift)" .
helix:cs_gift_type__foundation_grant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "foundation_grant" ; skos:prefLabel "Foundation Grant" ; skos:definition "Grant from a private or community foundation" .
helix:cs_gift_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_gift_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_grade_mode a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Grade Mode" ; skos:notation "helix/grade-mode" .
helix:cs_grade_mode__standard a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grade_mode ; skos:notation "standard" ; skos:prefLabel "Standard Letter Grade" ; skos:definition "Traditional A-F grading scale with GPA impact" .
helix:cs_grade_mode__pass_fail a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grade_mode ; skos:notation "pass_fail" ; skos:prefLabel "Pass/Fail" ; skos:definition "Binary pass or fail with no GPA impact" .
helix:cs_grade_mode__audit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grade_mode ; skos:notation "audit" ; skos:prefLabel "Audit" ; skos:definition "No grade or credit awarded; student attends for learning only" .
helix:cs_grade_mode__satisfactory_unsatisfactory a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grade_mode ; skos:notation "satisfactory_unsatisfactory" ; skos:prefLabel "Satisfactory/Unsatisfactory" ; skos:definition "S/U grading, common for graduate research hours or clinical rotations" .
helix:cs_grade_mode__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grade_mode ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "An institution-specific grading mode. Document in extensions." .
helix:cs_grant_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Grant/Sponsored Program Status" ; skos:notation "helix/grant-status" .
helix:cs_grant_status__pre_award a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "pre_award" ; skos:prefLabel "Pre-Award" ; skos:definition "Proposal submitted to the sponsor; award not yet received. Institutional pre-award office has reviewed budget, compliance, and authorized submission. May include pre-award spending authorization if sponsor allows." .
helix:cs_grant_status__pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending/Under Review" ; skos:definition "Proposal is being reviewed by the funding agency. May involve peer review, panel review, or program officer evaluation. Timeline varies: NSF 6 months, NIH 9-12 months, foundations 2-4 months." .
helix:cs_grant_status__negotiation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "negotiation" ; skos:prefLabel "Award Negotiation" ; skos:definition "Sponsor intends to fund but terms are being negotiated. Common negotiation points: F&A rate, cost sharing, publication rights, IP ownership, subaward terms, human subjects protocol approval." .
helix:cs_grant_status__active a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "active" ; skos:prefLabel "Active" ; skos:definition "Award received, account established, spending authorized. PI can charge allowable costs to the grant account. Subject to periodic reporting (technical and financial) per the award terms." .
helix:cs_grant_status__no_cost_extension a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "no_cost_extension" ; skos:prefLabel "No-Cost Extension (NCE)" ; skos:definition "Award period extended without additional funding. Allows the PI to complete the scope of work with remaining funds. First NCE may be grantee-approved (NIH, NSF); subsequent NCEs require sponsor approval." .
helix:cs_grant_status__suspended a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "suspended" ; skos:prefLabel "Suspended" ; skos:definition "Spending temporarily halted by the institution or sponsor. Common reasons: compliance violation, audit finding, IRB/IACUC protocol expiration, PI departure, effort certification delinquency." .
helix:cs_grant_status__closed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "closed" ; skos:prefLabel "Closed" ; skos:definition "Award period ended and all spending completed. Final financial report (FFR/SF-425) and technical report submitted to sponsor. Any unspent funds returned or applied per sponsor policy. Account closed to new charges." .
helix:cs_grant_status__final_reporting a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "final_reporting" ; skos:prefLabel "Final Reporting Period" ; skos:definition "Award has ended but the institution is within the final reporting window (typically 90-120 days). Final invoices, cost transfers, and adjustments being processed. Account open for adjustments only, not new spending." .
helix:cs_grant_status__audit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "audit" ; skos:prefLabel "Under Audit" ; skos:definition "Award selected for audit by the sponsor, OIG, or as part of the institution's Single Audit (2 CFR 200 Subpart F). Records must be retained and available. May delay account closure." .
helix:cs_grant_status__subaward_pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_grant_status ; skos:notation "subaward_pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Subaward Pending" ; skos:definition "Primary award is active but a subaward to a partner institution has not yet been fully executed. Monitoring status of the sub-recipient's compliance documentation and budget negotiation." .
helix:cs_hold_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Hold Type" ; skos:notation "helix/hold-type" .
helix:cs_hold_type__registration a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "registration" ; skos:prefLabel "Registration Hold" ; skos:definition "Prevents the student from registering for courses" .
helix:cs_hold_type__financial a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "financial" ; skos:prefLabel "Financial Hold" ; skos:definition "Unpaid balance or financial obligation. May prevent registration, transcript release, or graduation." .
helix:cs_hold_type__academic a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "academic" ; skos:prefLabel "Academic Hold" ; skos:definition "Academic deficiency (GPA, SAP, etc.). May require advising clearance before registration." .
helix:cs_hold_type__disciplinary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "disciplinary" ; skos:prefLabel "Disciplinary Hold" ; skos:definition "Conduct or disciplinary action pending or in effect" .
helix:cs_hold_type__transcript a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "transcript" ; skos:prefLabel "Transcript Hold" ; skos:definition "Prevents release of official transcripts" .
helix:cs_hold_type__graduation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "graduation" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduation Hold" ; skos:definition "Prevents degree conferral (e.g., outstanding requirements, exit interview)" .
helix:cs_hold_type__library a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "library" ; skos:prefLabel "Library Hold" ; skos:definition "Overdue materials or library fines" .
helix:cs_hold_type__health_compliance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "health_compliance" ; skos:prefLabel "Health Compliance Hold" ; skos:definition "Missing immunization records, health insurance verification, or other health requirements" .
helix:cs_hold_type__admissions a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "admissions" ; skos:prefLabel "Admissions Hold" ; skos:definition "Missing admissions documents (final transcript, test scores, etc.)" .
helix:cs_hold_type__international a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "international" ; skos:prefLabel "International Hold" ; skos:definition "Visa compliance, SEVIS reporting, or international student office clearance" .
helix:cs_hold_type__parking a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "parking" ; skos:prefLabel "Parking Hold" ; skos:definition "Unpaid parking fines or violations" .
helix:cs_hold_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_hold_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_honor_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Honor/Award Type" ; skos:notation "helix/honor-type" .
helix:cs_honor_type__latin_honors a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "latin_honors" ; skos:prefLabel "Latin Honors" ; skos:definition "Cum laude, magna cum laude, or summa cum laude designation" .
helix:cs_honor_type__deans_list a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "deans_list" ; skos:prefLabel "Dean's List" ; skos:definition "Term-based academic recognition by a college/school" .
helix:cs_honor_type__presidents_list a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "presidents_list" ; skos:prefLabel "President's List" ; skos:definition "Term-based academic recognition at the institutional level (typically highest GPA tier)" .
helix:cs_honor_type__departmental_award a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "departmental_award" ; skos:prefLabel "Departmental Award" ; skos:definition "Award granted by an academic department" .
helix:cs_honor_type__institutional_award a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "institutional_award" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional Award" ; skos:definition "Award granted at the institutional level" .
helix:cs_honor_type__national_award a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "national_award" ; skos:prefLabel "National Award" ; skos:definition "Nationally recognized award or honor (e.g., Fulbright, Goldwater)" .
helix:cs_honor_type__scholarship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "scholarship" ; skos:prefLabel "Scholarship" ; skos:definition "A scholarship awarded to the student" .
helix:cs_honor_type__fellowship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "fellowship" ; skos:prefLabel "Fellowship" ; skos:definition "A fellowship awarded to the student" .
helix:cs_honor_type__academic_distinction a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "academic_distinction" ; skos:prefLabel "Academic Distinction" ; skos:definition "General academic distinction or recognition" .
helix:cs_honor_type__graduation_honor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "graduation_honor" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduation Honor" ; skos:definition "Honor conferred at graduation (e.g., honors program completion)" .
helix:cs_honor_type__honor_society a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_honor_type ; skos:notation "honor_society" ; skos:prefLabel "Honor Society" ; skos:definition "Induction into an honor society (e.g., Phi Beta Kappa)" .
helix:cs_identifier_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Identifier Type" ; skos:notation "helix/identifier-type" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__institutional_id a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "institutional_id" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional ID" ; skos:definition "The primary student/person ID assigned by the institution" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__national_id a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "national_id" ; skos:prefLabel "National ID" ; skos:definition "Government-issued national identifier (e.g., SSN in US, SIN in Canada, NI Number in UK)" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__ssn_last4 a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "ssn_last4" ; skos:prefLabel "SSN Last 4" ; skos:definition "Last 4 digits of Social Security Number. Full SSN should never be stored in HELIX." .
helix:cs_identifier_type__passport a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "passport" ; skos:prefLabel "Passport Number" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__drivers_license a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "drivers_license" ; skos:prefLabel "Driver's License Number" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__login a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "login" ; skos:prefLabel "Login/Username" ; skos:definition "Institutional login or network username" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__email a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "email" ; skos:prefLabel "Email Address" ; skos:definition "When used as an identifier (e.g., for SSO matching)" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__erp_internal_key a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "erp_internal_key" ; skos:prefLabel "ERP Internal Key" ; skos:definition "System-generated internal key (e.g., Banner PIDM, PeopleSoft EmplID). Not typically exposed to end users." .
helix:cs_identifier_type__prior_institution_id a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "prior_institution_id" ; skos:prefLabel "Prior Institution ID" ; skos:definition "ID from a previous institution (useful for transfer matching)" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__clearing_house_id a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "clearing_house_id" ; skos:prefLabel "Clearing House ID" ; skos:definition "National Student Clearinghouse or equivalent ID" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__orcid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "orcid" ; skos:prefLabel "ORCID" ; skos:definition "Open Researcher and Contributor ID for research/publishing" .
helix:cs_identifier_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_identifier_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_learning_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Learning/Training Type" ; skos:notation "helix/learning-type" .
helix:cs_learning_type__course a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "course" ; skos:prefLabel "Formal Course" ; skos:definition "Credit or non-credit course taken at the institution or elsewhere, often under the tuition waiver benefit. May count toward a degree, certificate, or professional credential." .
helix:cs_learning_type__workshop a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "workshop" ; skos:prefLabel "Workshop" ; skos:definition "Structured, interactive training session, typically 2-8 hours. May be offered by HR, the teaching center, IT, or an external provider. Common topics: Banner navigation, budget management, inclusive teaching practices." .
helix:cs_learning_type__certification a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "certification" ; skos:prefLabel "Certification Program" ; skos:definition "Program leading to a professional credential (e.g., PMP, SHRM-CP, CPA continuing education, CITI research ethics). Institution may fund exam fees and preparation materials." .
helix:cs_learning_type__conference a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "conference" ; skos:prefLabel "Conference/Symposium" ; skos:definition "Professional conference attendance, including presentation or attendance. Funded through professional development budgets. Requires travel authorization and post-travel reporting at most institutions." .
helix:cs_learning_type__webinar a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "webinar" ; skos:prefLabel "Webinar/Virtual Training" ; skos:definition "Online synchronous training session. May be recorded for asynchronous viewing. Increasingly common for compliance training (Title IX, FERPA, cybersecurity awareness)." .
helix:cs_learning_type__self_paced a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "self_paced" ; skos:prefLabel "Self-Paced / E-Learning" ; skos:definition "Asynchronous online learning modules accessed through the LMS or external platform (LinkedIn Learning, Coursera, etc.). Often used for compliance training with completion tracking and certificate generation." .
helix:cs_learning_type__on_the_job a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "on_the_job" ; skos:prefLabel "On-the-Job Training" ; skos:definition "Structured learning occurring during normal work through observation, shadowing, job rotation, or stretch assignments. Typically documented in the performance management system." .
helix:cs_learning_type__mentoring a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "mentoring" ; skos:prefLabel "Mentoring Program" ; skos:definition "Formal or informal pairing of experienced and less-experienced employees for professional growth. May be part of new employee onboarding, leadership development, or faculty development programs." .
helix:cs_learning_type__compliance_training a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_learning_type ; skos:notation "compliance_training" ; skos:prefLabel "Mandatory Compliance Training" ; skos:definition "Required training for regulatory compliance: Title IX, FERPA, GLBA information security, Clery Act, hazardous materials, conflict of interest, responsible conduct of research, driver safety. Non-completion may trigger hold on system access or pay." .
helix:cs_licensure_result a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Licensure Result" ; skos:notation "helix/licensure-result" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__pass a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "pass" ; skos:prefLabel "Pass" ; skos:definition "Passed the examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__fail a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "fail" ; skos:prefLabel "Fail" ; skos:definition "Did not pass the examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__pass_first_attempt a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "pass_first_attempt" ; skos:prefLabel "Pass - First Attempt" ; skos:definition "Passed on the first attempt (key accreditation metric)" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__pass_subsequent_attempt a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "pass_subsequent_attempt" ; skos:prefLabel "Pass - Subsequent Attempt" ; skos:definition "Passed on a subsequent attempt" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending" ; skos:definition "Result pending" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__scheduled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "scheduled" ; skos:prefLabel "Scheduled" ; skos:definition "Exam scheduled but not yet taken" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__no_show a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "no_show" ; skos:prefLabel "No Show" ; skos:definition "Registered but did not sit for the exam" .
helix:cs_licensure_result__conditional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_result ; skos:notation "conditional" ; skos:prefLabel "Conditional" ; skos:definition "Conditional pass pending additional requirements" .
helix:cs_licensure_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Licensure/Certification Type" ; skos:notation "helix/licensure-type" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__nursing_nclex a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "nursing_nclex" ; skos:prefLabel "Nursing - NCLEX" ; skos:definition "National Council Licensure Examination for nurses (NCLEX-RN, NCLEX-PN)" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__cpa a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "cpa" ; skos:prefLabel "CPA Exam" ; skos:definition "Uniform Certified Public Accountant Examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__bar_exam a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "bar_exam" ; skos:prefLabel "Bar Exam" ; skos:definition "State bar examination for attorneys" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__teaching_praxis a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "teaching_praxis" ; skos:prefLabel "Teaching - Praxis" ; skos:definition "Praxis series exams for teacher licensure" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__medical_usmle a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "medical_usmle" ; skos:prefLabel "Medical - USMLE" ; skos:definition "United States Medical Licensing Examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__pharmacy_naplex a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "pharmacy_naplex" ; skos:prefLabel "Pharmacy - NAPLEX" ; skos:definition "North American Pharmacist Licensure Examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__engineering_pe a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "engineering_pe" ; skos:prefLabel "Engineering - PE/FE" ; skos:definition "Fundamentals of Engineering and Principles and Practice of Engineering exams" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__social_work a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "social_work" ; skos:prefLabel "Social Work" ; skos:definition "ASWB social work licensure examination" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__counseling a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "counseling" ; skos:prefLabel "Counseling" ; skos:definition "Counseling licensure examination (e.g., NCE)" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__dental a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "dental" ; skos:prefLabel "Dental" ; skos:definition "Dental licensure examination (e.g., INBDE)" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__veterinary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "veterinary" ; skos:prefLabel "Veterinary" ; skos:definition "North American Veterinary Licensing Examination (NAVLE)" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__physical_therapy a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "physical_therapy" ; skos:prefLabel "Physical Therapy" ; skos:definition "National Physical Therapy Examination (NPTE)" .
helix:cs_licensure_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_licensure_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "Another professional licensure or certification exam" .
helix:cs_loan_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Loan Status" ; skos:notation "helix/loan-status" .
helix:cs_loan_status__originated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "originated" ; skos:prefLabel "Originated" ; skos:definition "Loan originated" .
helix:cs_loan_status__pending_mpn a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "pending_mpn" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending MPN" ; skos:definition "Awaiting a signed Master Promissory Note" .
helix:cs_loan_status__pending_counseling a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "pending_counseling" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Counseling" ; skos:definition "Awaiting required entrance counseling" .
helix:cs_loan_status__certified a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "certified" ; skos:prefLabel "Certified" ; skos:definition "Loan certified by the school" .
helix:cs_loan_status__disbursed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "disbursed" ; skos:prefLabel "Disbursed" ; skos:definition "Loan funds disbursed" .
helix:cs_loan_status__in_school_deferment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "in_school_deferment" ; skos:prefLabel "In-School Deferment" ; skos:definition "In deferment while enrolled" .
helix:cs_loan_status__grace_period a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "grace_period" ; skos:prefLabel "Grace Period" ; skos:definition "In post-enrollment grace period" .
helix:cs_loan_status__repayment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "repayment" ; skos:prefLabel "Repayment" ; skos:definition "In active repayment" .
helix:cs_loan_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Loan cancelled/inactivated" .
helix:cs_loan_status__returned a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_status ; skos:notation "returned" ; skos:prefLabel "Returned" ; skos:definition "Loan funds returned to the servicer/COD" .
helix:cs_loan_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Loan Type" ; skos:notation "helix/loan-type" .
helix:cs_loan_type__direct_subsidized a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "direct_subsidized" ; skos:prefLabel "Direct Subsidized Loan" ; skos:definition "Need-based federal Direct Subsidized Loan" .
helix:cs_loan_type__direct_unsubsidized a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "direct_unsubsidized" ; skos:prefLabel "Direct Unsubsidized Loan" ; skos:definition "Non-need federal Direct Unsubsidized Loan" .
helix:cs_loan_type__direct_plus_parent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "direct_plus_parent" ; skos:prefLabel "Direct PLUS (Parent)" ; skos:definition "Federal Direct PLUS loan to a parent (Parent PLUS)" .
helix:cs_loan_type__direct_plus_grad a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "direct_plus_grad" ; skos:prefLabel "Direct PLUS (Graduate)" ; skos:definition "Federal Direct PLUS loan to a graduate/professional student (Grad PLUS)" .
helix:cs_loan_type__perkins a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "perkins" ; skos:prefLabel "Federal Perkins Loan" ; skos:definition "Legacy Federal Perkins Loan (program ended 2017)" .
helix:cs_loan_type__direct_consolidation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "direct_consolidation" ; skos:prefLabel "Direct Consolidation Loan" ; skos:definition "Federal Direct Consolidation Loan" .
helix:cs_loan_type__private_alternative a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "private_alternative" ; skos:prefLabel "Private/Alternative Loan" ; skos:definition "Private education loan from a non-federal lender" .
helix:cs_loan_type__institutional_loan a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "institutional_loan" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional Loan" ; skos:definition "Loan funded by the institution" .
helix:cs_loan_type__heal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_loan_type ; skos:notation "heal" ; skos:prefLabel "HEAL" ; skos:definition "Health Education Assistance Loan (legacy)" .
helix:cs_outcome_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Learning Outcome Type" ; skos:notation "helix/outcome-type" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__program_learning_outcome a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "program_learning_outcome" ; skos:prefLabel "Program Learning Outcome (PLO)" ; skos:definition "A learning outcome defined at the program/major level" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__course_learning_outcome a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "course_learning_outcome" ; skos:prefLabel "Course Learning Outcome (CLO)" ; skos:definition "A learning outcome defined at the course level" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__institutional_learning_outcome a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "institutional_learning_outcome" ; skos:prefLabel "Institutional Learning Outcome (ILO)" ; skos:definition "An institution-wide learning outcome" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__general_education_competency a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "general_education_competency" ; skos:prefLabel "General Education Competency" ; skos:definition "A general-education/core-curriculum competency" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__professional_competency a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "professional_competency" ; skos:prefLabel "Professional Competency" ; skos:definition "A profession-specific competency, often accreditation-defined" .
helix:cs_outcome_type__accreditation_standard a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_outcome_type ; skos:notation "accreditation_standard" ; skos:prefLabel "Accreditation Standard" ; skos:definition "An outcome mapped directly to an accreditation standard" .
helix:cs_pay_frequency a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Pay Frequency" ; skos:notation "helix/pay-frequency" .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__biweekly a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "biweekly" ; skos:prefLabel "Biweekly" ; skos:definition "Paid every two weeks (26 pay periods per year). Most common for hourly/non-exempt staff in higher education. Creates occasional three-paycheck months." .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__semimonthly a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "semimonthly" ; skos:prefLabel "Semi-Monthly" ; skos:definition "Paid twice per month, typically on the 1st and 15th or 15th and last day (24 pay periods per year). Common for exempt staff at some institutions." .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__monthly a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "monthly" ; skos:prefLabel "Monthly" ; skos:definition "Paid once per month (12 pay periods per year). Most common for faculty and senior administrators. 9-month faculty may receive pay over 9 or 12 months depending on election." .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__weekly a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "weekly" ; skos:prefLabel "Weekly" ; skos:definition "Paid every week (52 pay periods per year). Less common in higher ed; used at some institutions for temporary and student workers." .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__annual a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "annual" ; skos:prefLabel "Annual (Lump Sum)" ; skos:definition "Single payment for the full appointment period. Used for some fellowship stipends, one-time consulting arrangements, or athletic bonuses." .
helix:cs_pay_frequency__per_course a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_pay_frequency ; skos:notation "per_course" ; skos:prefLabel "Per Course" ; skos:definition "Compensation calculated and paid per course taught. Standard for adjunct faculty. Payment schedule varies: lump sum at term start, split across term pay periods, or paid at term end." .
helix:cs_payment_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Payment Status" ; skos:notation "helix/payment-status" .
helix:cs_payment_status__pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending" ; skos:definition "Payment request received but not yet approved or scheduled. Awaiting department approval, budget check, or documentation review." .
helix:cs_payment_status__approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved" ; skos:definition "Payment approved through all required authorization levels. Queued for the next payment cycle." .
helix:cs_payment_status__scheduled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "scheduled" ; skos:prefLabel "Scheduled" ; skos:definition "Payment approved and included in an upcoming payment batch. Payment date and method (check, ACH, wire) assigned." .
helix:cs_payment_status__paid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "paid" ; skos:prefLabel "Paid" ; skos:definition "Payment issued to the payee. For checks: printed and mailed/distributed. For ACH/wire: transmitted to the bank. Payment number and date recorded." .
helix:cs_payment_status__voided a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "voided" ; skos:prefLabel "Voided" ; skos:definition "Payment cancelled after issuance but before clearing. For checks: stop payment issued. Creates a reversing entry against the original payment. Requires re-issuance if the underlying obligation remains." .
helix:cs_payment_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Payment request cancelled before issuance. The voucher or payment request is closed. Budget and encumbrance may be released." .
helix:cs_payment_status__returned a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "returned" ; skos:prefLabel "Returned" ; skos:definition "Payment returned by the bank (ACH return, uncashed check). Common reasons: incorrect account number, closed account, deceased payee. Triggers re-investigation and re-issuance." .
helix:cs_payment_status__partially_paid a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "partially_paid" ; skos:prefLabel "Partially Paid" ; skos:definition "Only a portion of the invoiced amount has been paid. Remaining balance is open. Common for progress payments on contracts, partial shipments on POs, or payment disputes." .
helix:cs_payment_status__held a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_payment_status ; skos:notation "held" ; skos:prefLabel "Held/On Hold" ; skos:definition "Payment approved but intentionally held from disbursement. Reasons: vendor dispute, W-9 not on file, missing tax ID, debarred vendor flag, or 1099 compliance issue." .
helix:cs_performance_rating a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Performance Rating" ; skos:notation "helix/performance-rating" .
helix:cs_performance_rating__exceptional a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "exceptional" ; skos:prefLabel "Exceptional" ; skos:definition "Performance consistently and significantly exceeds expectations. Demonstrates outstanding contributions, innovation, and impact well beyond the scope of the position. Reserved for truly extraordinary performance (typically no more than 5-10% of workforce)." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__exceeds_expectations a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "exceeds_expectations" ; skos:prefLabel "Exceeds Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance regularly exceeds the requirements of the position. Delivers high-quality work ahead of schedule, takes on additional responsibilities, and contributes beyond assigned duties." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__meets_expectations a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "meets_expectations" ; skos:prefLabel "Meets Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance fully meets the requirements and standards of the position. Consistently delivers quality work, meets deadlines, and fulfills all position responsibilities. This is the expected performance level for a competent employee." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__partially_meets a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "partially_meets" ; skos:prefLabel "Partially Meets Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance meets some but not all position requirements. Some areas need improvement. Typically triggers a performance improvement plan (PIP) with specific goals, timeline (30-90 days), and support resources." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__does_not_meet a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "does_not_meet" ; skos:prefLabel "Does Not Meet Expectations" ; skos:definition "Performance fails to meet minimum requirements of the position despite prior feedback and support. May trigger formal corrective action, reassignment, or termination process. Must be well-documented." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__not_rated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "not_rated" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Rated" ; skos:definition "Performance not formally evaluated for this period. Used for new employees in probationary period, employees on extended leave, or positions where evaluation was deferred." .
helix:cs_performance_rating__improvement_demonstrated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_performance_rating ; skos:notation "improvement_demonstrated" ; skos:prefLabel "Improvement Demonstrated" ; skos:definition "Used following a performance improvement plan (PIP). Employee has shown measurable progress toward meeting expectations but monitoring continues. PIP may be extended or concluded." .
helix:cs_period_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Academic Period Type" ; skos:notation "helix/period-type" .
helix:cs_period_type__semester a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "semester" ; skos:prefLabel "Semester" ; skos:definition "A ~15-week academic term (typically Fall, Spring). Most common in US institutions." .
helix:cs_period_type__quarter a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "quarter" ; skos:prefLabel "Quarter" ; skos:definition "A ~10-week academic term (typically Fall, Winter, Spring, Summer)" .
helix:cs_period_type__trimester a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "trimester" ; skos:prefLabel "Trimester" ; skos:definition "A ~13-week term dividing the year into three periods" .
helix:cs_period_type__session a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "session" ; skos:prefLabel "Session" ; skos:definition "A sub-term or accelerated term within a semester or quarter" .
helix:cs_period_type__mini_term a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "mini_term" ; skos:prefLabel "Mini-Term" ; skos:definition "A short-duration term (e.g., May term, Winterim, 8-week session)" .
helix:cs_period_type__academic_year a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "academic_year" ; skos:prefLabel "Academic Year" ; skos:definition "A full academic year container (e.g., '2026-2027'). Used for annual financial aid and reporting." .
helix:cs_period_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_period_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "A period type not covered by the standard codes. Document in extensions." .
helix:cs_position_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Position Status" ; skos:notation "helix/position-status" .
helix:cs_position_status__open a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "open" ; skos:prefLabel "Open" ; skos:definition "Position is authorized and funded but currently vacant. Available for recruitment or internal transfer." .
helix:cs_position_status__filled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "filled" ; skos:prefLabel "Filled" ; skos:definition "Position is occupied by an active worker. One position may map to multiple workers if job-shared." .
helix:cs_position_status__frozen a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "frozen" ; skos:prefLabel "Frozen" ; skos:definition "Position exists in the system but hiring is suspended, typically due to budget constraints or hiring freeze. The position's budget may be temporarily redirected." .
helix:cs_position_status__abolished a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "abolished" ; skos:prefLabel "Abolished" ; skos:definition "Position has been permanently eliminated. Budget line removed. Cannot be filled without re-creation through position management approval process." .
helix:cs_position_status__proposed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "proposed" ; skos:prefLabel "Proposed" ; skos:definition "New position request submitted but not yet approved through governance process. Awaiting budget approval, classification review, and/or provost/VP authorization." .
helix:cs_position_status__pooled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_position_status ; skos:notation "pooled" ; skos:prefLabel "Pooled" ; skos:definition "Position used for temporary or student worker appointments where multiple individuals can be appointed against the same position number. Common for adjunct pools, student worker pools." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Prospect Stage (Moves Management)" ; skos:notation "helix/prospect-stage" .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__identification a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "identification" ; skos:prefLabel "Identification" ; skos:definition "Prospect identified through screening, referral, or research. Not yet qualified." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__qualification a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "qualification" ; skos:prefLabel "Qualification" ; skos:definition "Research and initial outreach to determine interest, capacity, and inclination." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__cultivation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "cultivation" ; skos:prefLabel "Cultivation" ; skos:definition "Active relationship-building: meetings, events, campus visits, engagement activities." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__solicitation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "solicitation" ; skos:prefLabel "Solicitation" ; skos:definition "Formal ask has been made or is imminent." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__stewardship a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "stewardship" ; skos:prefLabel "Stewardship" ; skos:definition "Post-gift acknowledgment, impact reporting, and continued relationship management." .
helix:cs_prospect_stage__none a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_prospect_stage ; skos:notation "none" ; skos:prefLabel "Not in Pipeline" ; skos:definition "Constituent is not currently in the moves management pipeline." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Purchase Order Status" ; skos:notation "helix/purchase-order-status" .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__draft a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "draft" ; skos:prefLabel "Draft" ; skos:definition "PO created but not yet submitted for approval. Requester is finalizing specifications, quantities, vendor selection, and budget coding." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__pending_approval a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "pending_approval" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Approval" ; skos:definition "PO submitted and routing through institutional approval workflow. Approval levels determined by dollar amount (e.g., department head up to $5K, dean up to $25K, VP up to $100K, president/board above)." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved" ; skos:definition "PO approved at all required levels. Budget checked and encumbered. Ready to dispatch to vendor." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__dispatched a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "dispatched" ; skos:prefLabel "Dispatched" ; skos:definition "PO sent to the vendor. Serves as the institution's contractual commitment to purchase. Includes delivery terms, payment terms, and any special conditions." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__partially_received a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "partially_received" ; skos:prefLabel "Partially Received" ; skos:definition "Some items on the PO have been received and receipted; others are outstanding. Partial payment may be processed via 3-way match (PO, receipt, invoice)." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__received a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "received" ; skos:prefLabel "Fully Received" ; skos:definition "All items/services on the PO have been received and receipted. Ready for final invoice matching and payment processing." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__closed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "closed" ; skos:prefLabel "Closed" ; skos:definition "PO fully received and all invoices paid. Any remaining encumbrance is liquidated (released back to available budget). PO is archived." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "PO cancelled before completion. Encumbrance reversed. If any payments were made (partial receipt), the cancellation applies only to the unreceived portion. May require vendor notification." .
helix:cs_purchase_order_status__change_order a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_purchase_order_status ; skos:notation "change_order" ; skos:prefLabel "Change Order/Amendment" ; skos:definition "PO modified after dispatch. Changes may include quantity, price, delivery date, or specifications. Requires approval and may re-trigger budget checking if the total increases." .
helix:cs_r2t4_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Return of Title IV (R2T4) Status" ; skos:notation "helix/r2t4-status" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__withdrawal_reported a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "withdrawal_reported" ; skos:prefLabel "Withdrawal Reported" ; skos:definition "A withdrawal has been reported" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__calculation_pending a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "calculation_pending" ; skos:prefLabel "Calculation Pending" ; skos:definition "R2T4 calculation not yet completed" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__calculation_complete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "calculation_complete" ; skos:prefLabel "Calculation Complete" ; skos:definition "R2T4 calculation completed" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__funds_returned a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "funds_returned" ; skos:prefLabel "Funds Returned" ; skos:definition "Required funds returned by school and/or student" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__post_withdrawal_offered a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "post_withdrawal_offered" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Withdrawal Disbursement Offered" ; skos:definition "A post-withdrawal disbursement was offered" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__pwd_disbursed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "pwd_disbursed" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Withdrawal Disbursement Made" ; skos:definition "A post-withdrawal disbursement was made" .
helix:cs_r2t4_status__closed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_r2t4_status ; skos:notation "closed" ; skos:prefLabel "Closed" ; skos:definition "R2T4 process closed" .
helix:cs_requisition_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Requisition Status" ; skos:notation "helix/requisition-status" .
helix:cs_requisition_status__draft a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "draft" ; skos:prefLabel "Draft" ; skos:definition "Requisition created but not yet submitted for approval. Hiring manager is still completing position details, justification, and funding information." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__pending_approval a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "pending_approval" ; skos:prefLabel "Pending Approval" ; skos:definition "Requisition submitted and awaiting approval through the institutional chain (department head, dean/VP, budget office, HR classification, provost, president, varies by position level)." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved" ; skos:definition "Requisition approved through all required levels. Ready for posting. HR may need to finalize the job posting language and determine advertising venues." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__posted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "posted" ; skos:prefLabel "Posted" ; skos:definition "Position actively advertised and accepting applications. May be posted internally only, externally, or both. Posting duration governed by policy (minimum 5-14 days typical for staff; 30+ days for faculty)." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__interviewing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "interviewing" ; skos:prefLabel "Interviewing/Screening" ; skos:definition "Application review period closed (or ongoing for rolling review). Search committee or hiring manager is conducting phone screens, interviews, reference checks, and campus visits (for faculty and senior positions)." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__offer_extended a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "offer_extended" ; skos:prefLabel "Offer Extended" ; skos:definition "Preferred candidate identified and formal offer letter sent. Awaiting candidate response. May be contingent on background check, degree verification, and/or board approval." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__filled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "filled" ; skos:prefLabel "Filled" ; skos:definition "Candidate accepted offer and start date confirmed. Requisition closed. Triggers onboarding workflow (I-9, benefits enrollment, system access provisioning, orientation scheduling)." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__cancelled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "cancelled" ; skos:prefLabel "Cancelled" ; skos:definition "Requisition withdrawn. Search terminated without a hire. May be due to budget cuts, reorganization, failed search (no suitable candidates), or decision to redefine the position." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__on_hold a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "on_hold" ; skos:prefLabel "On Hold" ; skos:definition "Requisition temporarily suspended. Common during budget uncertainty, hiring freezes, or when the search is paused for administrative reasons. Can be reactivated without re-approval at some institutions." .
helix:cs_requisition_status__waiver_requested a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_requisition_status ; skos:notation "waiver_requested" ; skos:prefLabel "Search Waiver Requested" ; skos:definition "Request submitted to bypass standard search process for a direct appointment (e.g., internal promotion, spousal/partner hire, emergency appointment). Requires EEO/AA office and senior leadership approval." .
helix:cs_sap_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Satisfactory Academic Progress (SAP) Status" ; skos:notation "helix/sap-status" .
helix:cs_sap_status__meeting a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "meeting" ; skos:prefLabel "Meeting SAP" ; skos:definition "Student meets all SAP requirements (GPA, pace, maximum timeframe)" .
helix:cs_sap_status__warning a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "warning" ; skos:prefLabel "SAP Warning" ; skos:definition "Student failed to meet SAP at the end of a payment period. Eligible for aid for one more period without appeal." .
helix:cs_sap_status__probation a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "probation" ; skos:prefLabel "SAP Probation" ; skos:definition "Student failed SAP, appealed successfully, and is on a monitored academic plan. Eligible for aid while on plan." .
helix:cs_sap_status__suspension a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "suspension" ; skos:prefLabel "SAP Suspension" ; skos:definition "Student is ineligible for federal financial aid due to failure to meet SAP requirements" .
helix:cs_sap_status__appeal_approved a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "appeal_approved" ; skos:prefLabel "Appeal Approved" ; skos:definition "SAP appeal approved. Student placed on probation with an academic plan." .
helix:cs_sap_status__not_evaluated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_sap_status ; skos:notation "not_evaluated" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Yet Evaluated" ; skos:definition "SAP has not been evaluated for this period (e.g., first term)" .
helix:cs_student_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Student Status" ; skos:notation "helix/student-status" .
helix:cs_student_status__prospective a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "prospective" ; skos:prefLabel "Prospective" ; skos:definition "Person has expressed interest but has not applied" .
helix:cs_student_status__applicant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "applicant" ; skos:prefLabel "Applicant" ; skos:definition "Person has submitted an application for admission" .
helix:cs_student_status__admitted a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "admitted" ; skos:prefLabel "Admitted" ; skos:definition "Application accepted; student has not yet enrolled" .
helix:cs_student_status__enrolled a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "enrolled" ; skos:prefLabel "Enrolled" ; skos:definition "Student is actively registered in courses for a current or future term" .
helix:cs_student_status__leave_of_absence a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "leave_of_absence" ; skos:prefLabel "Leave of Absence" ; skos:definition "Student has an approved leave and intends to return" .
helix:cs_student_status__withdrawn a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "withdrawn" ; skos:prefLabel "Withdrawn" ; skos:definition "Student has voluntarily or administratively separated from the institution" .
helix:cs_student_status__graduated a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "graduated" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduated" ; skos:definition "Student has been conferred a degree, certificate, or credential" .
helix:cs_student_status__deceased a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_status ; skos:notation "deceased" ; skos:prefLabel "Deceased" ; skos:definition "Student is deceased. Record retained for historical and compliance purposes." .
helix:cs_student_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Student Type" ; skos:notation "helix/student-type" .
helix:cs_student_type__first_time_freshman a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "first_time_freshman" ; skos:prefLabel "First-Time Freshman" ; skos:definition "Entering college for the first time (no prior postsecondary enrollment). IPEDS: First-time, first-year." .
helix:cs_student_type__transfer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "transfer" ; skos:prefLabel "Transfer Student" ; skos:definition "Entering with credits from another postsecondary institution" .
helix:cs_student_type__readmit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "readmit" ; skos:prefLabel "Readmit" ; skos:definition "Previously enrolled at this institution, returning after a break in enrollment" .
helix:cs_student_type__continuing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "continuing" ; skos:prefLabel "Continuing Student" ; skos:definition "Currently enrolled, returning for the next term without a break" .
helix:cs_student_type__dual_enrollment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "dual_enrollment" ; skos:prefLabel "Dual Enrollment" ; skos:definition "High school student simultaneously enrolled in college courses" .
helix:cs_student_type__transient a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "transient" ; skos:prefLabel "Transient/Visiting" ; skos:definition "Enrolled at another institution but taking courses here temporarily" .
helix:cs_student_type__non_degree a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "non_degree" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Degree Seeking" ; skos:definition "Taking courses without pursuing a degree or credential" .
helix:cs_student_type__post_baccalaureate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "post_baccalaureate" ; skos:prefLabel "Post-Baccalaureate" ; skos:definition "Has a bachelor's degree, taking additional undergraduate courses" .
helix:cs_student_type__audit_only a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "audit_only" ; skos:prefLabel "Audit Only" ; skos:definition "Enrolled solely to audit courses without credit" .
helix:cs_student_type__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_student_type ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_survey_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Survey Status" ; skos:notation "helix/survey-status" .
helix:cs_survey_status__not_sent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "not_sent" ; skos:prefLabel "Not Sent" ; skos:definition "Survey has not yet been sent" .
helix:cs_survey_status__sent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "sent" ; skos:prefLabel "Sent" ; skos:definition "Survey has been sent to the graduate" .
helix:cs_survey_status__in_progress a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "in_progress" ; skos:prefLabel "In Progress" ; skos:definition "Survey response is in progress" .
helix:cs_survey_status__completed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "completed" ; skos:prefLabel "Completed" ; skos:definition "Survey fully completed" .
helix:cs_survey_status__partial a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "partial" ; skos:prefLabel "Partial" ; skos:definition "Survey partially completed" .
helix:cs_survey_status__no_response a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "no_response" ; skos:prefLabel "No Response" ; skos:definition "No response received" .
helix:cs_survey_status__opted_out a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_survey_status ; skos:notation "opted_out" ; skos:prefLabel "Opted Out" ; skos:definition "Graduate opted out of the survey" .
helix:cs_tenure_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Tenure Status" ; skos:notation "helix/tenure-status" .
helix:cs_tenure_status__pre_tenure a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_tenure_status ; skos:notation "pre_tenure" ; skos:prefLabel "Pre-Tenure (Probationary)" ; skos:definition "Faculty member on the tenure track who has not yet undergone tenure review. Typically in a 6-year probationary period with annual reviews and a mid-probationary (third-year) review. Clock extensions may be granted for qualifying life events." .
helix:cs_tenure_status__tenured a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_tenure_status ; skos:notation "tenured" ; skos:prefLabel "Tenured" ; skos:definition "Faculty member who has been granted tenure following successful review. Provides protection against termination without cause (financial exigency, program discontinuance, or adequate cause with due process). The cornerstone of academic freedom." .
helix:cs_tenure_status__non_tenure_track a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_tenure_status ; skos:notation "non_tenure_track" ; skos:prefLabel "Non-Tenure-Track (NTT)" ; skos:definition "Faculty member in a position not eligible for tenure. Includes lecturers, clinical faculty, research faculty, professors of practice, and adjuncts. Appointments may be single-year, multi-year, or rolling. Increasingly the majority of faculty in US higher education." .
helix:cs_tenure_status__tenure_denied a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_tenure_status ; skos:notation "tenure_denied" ; skos:prefLabel "Tenure Denied" ; skos:definition "Faculty member whose tenure application was not approved. Typically results in a terminal-year appointment (one additional year). Denial decisions may be appealed through faculty grievance processes." .
helix:cs_tenure_status__tenure_revoked a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_tenure_status ; skos:notation "tenure_revoked" ; skos:prefLabel "Tenure Revoked" ; skos:definition "Tenure removed through formal proceedings for adequate cause (e.g., professional misconduct, research fraud, dereliction of duty). Requires due process consistent with AAUP guidelines and institutional policy. Extremely rare." .
helix:cs_transaction_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "GL Transaction Type" ; skos:notation "helix/transaction-type" .
helix:cs_transaction_type__journal_entry a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "journal_entry" ; skos:prefLabel "Manual Journal Entry" ; skos:definition "Standard journal entry created by accounting staff to record transactions not captured by subsidiary systems (payroll, AP, AR). Requires balancing debits and credits with supporting documentation." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__standard a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "standard" ; skos:prefLabel "Standard/System-Generated" ; skos:definition "Automatic journal entry generated by a subsidiary system (payroll, accounts payable, billing, grants). Posted through batch or real-time integration. Represents the majority of GL activity." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__adjustment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "adjustment" ; skos:prefLabel "Adjustment" ; skos:definition "Entry to correct an error, reclassify an expense, or adjust an estimate. Requires explanation/justification and typically additional approval. Common at month-end and year-end." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__accrual a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "accrual" ; skos:prefLabel "Accrual" ; skos:definition "Entry to recognize revenue earned or expenses incurred but not yet recorded in cash basis. Examples: unbilled grant revenue, accrued payroll, accrued vacation liability. Required for GAAP compliance." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__reversal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "reversal" ; skos:prefLabel "Reversal" ; skos:definition "Entry that exactly reverses a previous entry, typically an accrual from the prior period. May be automatic (auto-reverse flag) or manual. Posted at the start of the new period." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__closing a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "closing" ; skos:prefLabel "Closing Entry" ; skos:definition "Year-end entry to close revenue and expenditure accounts to fund balance. In fund accounting, closes each fund separately. Prepares the ledger for the new fiscal year." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__reclassification a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "reclassification" ; skos:prefLabel "Reclassification" ; skos:definition "Entry to move amounts between chartfield combinations (accounts, departments, funds, programs) without changing the net financial position. Common for correcting coding errors or reallocating shared costs." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__elimination a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "elimination" ; skos:prefLabel "Elimination" ; skos:definition "Entry to eliminate intra-entity transactions in consolidated financial statements. Used when the institution has component units (foundations, hospital, research corporations) that must be consolidated per GASB standards." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__statistical a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "statistical" ; skos:prefLabel "Statistical Entry" ; skos:definition "Non-monetary entry recording statistical data (headcount, square footage, FTE) in the ledger for allocation and reporting purposes. Does not affect financial balances." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__budget_entry a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "budget_entry" ; skos:prefLabel "Budget Entry" ; skos:definition "Entry to record the original budget, budget modifications, or encumbrances. In commitment control systems (PeopleSoft), budget entries establish spending authority against which transactions are checked." .
helix:cs_transaction_type__encumbrance a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_transaction_type ; skos:notation "encumbrance" ; skos:prefLabel "Encumbrance" ; skos:definition "Entry to reserve budget for a committed future expenditure (purchase order, contract, salary commitment). Reduces available budget without recording an actual expense. Liquidated when the actual expense posts." .
helix:cs_verification_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Verification Status" ; skos:notation "helix/verification-status" .
helix:cs_verification_status__selected a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "selected" ; skos:prefLabel "Selected" ; skos:definition "ISIR selected for verification" .
helix:cs_verification_status__documents_requested a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "documents_requested" ; skos:prefLabel "Documents Requested" ; skos:definition "Required documents requested from the student" .
helix:cs_verification_status__documents_partial a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "documents_partial" ; skos:prefLabel "Documents Partial" ; skos:definition "Some but not all documents received" .
helix:cs_verification_status__documents_complete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "documents_complete" ; skos:prefLabel "Documents Complete" ; skos:definition "All required documents received" .
helix:cs_verification_status__in_review a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "in_review" ; skos:prefLabel "In Review" ; skos:definition "Documents under review" .
helix:cs_verification_status__conflicting_information a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "conflicting_information" ; skos:prefLabel "Conflicting Information" ; skos:definition "Conflicting information identified; must be resolved" .
helix:cs_verification_status__completed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "completed" ; skos:prefLabel "Completed" ; skos:definition "Verification completed" .
helix:cs_verification_status__incomplete a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "incomplete" ; skos:prefLabel "Incomplete" ; skos:definition "Verification not completed; aid may be forfeited" .
helix:cs_verification_status__waived a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_verification_status ; skos:notation "waived" ; skos:prefLabel "Waived" ; skos:definition "Verification requirement waived per allowable exclusion" .
helix:cs_veteran_status a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Veteran Status" ; skos:notation "helix/veteran-status" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__none a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "none" ; skos:prefLabel "No Military Affiliation" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__veteran a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "veteran" ; skos:prefLabel "Veteran" ; skos:definition "Former member of the armed forces who has been discharged" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__active_duty a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "active_duty" ; skos:prefLabel "Active Duty" ; skos:definition "Currently serving in the armed forces" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__reserve_national_guard a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "reserve_national_guard" ; skos:prefLabel "Reserve / National Guard" ; skos:definition "Member of a reserve component or National Guard" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__dependent_spouse a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "dependent_spouse" ; skos:prefLabel "Military Dependent/Spouse" ; skos:definition "Dependent or spouse of a service member, eligible for benefits (e.g., Chapter 35, MyCAA)" .
helix:cs_veteran_status__other a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_veteran_status ; skos:notation "other" ; skos:prefLabel "Other" ; skos:definition "" .
helix:cs_worker_type a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Worker Type" ; skos:notation "helix/worker-type" .
helix:cs_worker_type__regular a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "regular" ; skos:prefLabel "Regular" ; skos:definition "Permanent employee on the institutional payroll with benefits eligibility. Includes both full-time and part-time regular appointments." .
helix:cs_worker_type__temporary a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "temporary" ; skos:prefLabel "Temporary" ; skos:definition "Employee hired for a defined period, typically not to exceed 12 months. May or may not be benefits-eligible depending on FTE and institutional policy." .
helix:cs_worker_type__contingent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "contingent" ; skos:prefLabel "Contingent Worker" ; skos:definition "Individual engaged through a staffing agency or third-party arrangement. Not on the institutional payroll; paid through accounts payable." .
helix:cs_worker_type__contractor a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "contractor" ; skos:prefLabel "Independent Contractor" ; skos:definition "Individual providing services under a contract (1099). Must meet IRS independent contractor tests. Not an employee for benefits, tax withholding, or FLSA purposes." .
helix:cs_worker_type__student_worker a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "student_worker" ; skos:prefLabel "Student Worker" ; skos:definition "Currently enrolled student employed by the institution. Includes Federal Work-Study (FWS), institutional employment, and hourly student positions. Typically exempt from FICA if enrolled half-time or more." .
helix:cs_worker_type__graduate_assistant a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "graduate_assistant" ; skos:prefLabel "Graduate Assistant" ; skos:definition "Graduate student holding a funded assistantship (GA, TA, RA). Typically receives tuition remission plus stipend. May be classified as student or employee depending on state law and collective bargaining status." .
helix:cs_worker_type__intern a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "intern" ; skos:prefLabel "Intern" ; skos:definition "Individual in a structured learning experience, paid or unpaid. Unpaid internships at for-profit entities must meet DOL primary beneficiary test; universities have more flexibility under educational exception." .
helix:cs_worker_type__fellow a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "fellow" ; skos:prefLabel "Fellow" ; skos:definition "Individual receiving a fellowship (external or institutional) for research or scholarly activity. May not have an employment relationship; fellowship stipends are often non-compensatory and reported on 1099-MISC or 1042-S." .
helix:cs_worker_type__volunteer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "volunteer" ; skos:prefLabel "Volunteer" ; skos:definition "Individual providing services without expectation of compensation. Must meet FLSA volunteer criteria. Cannot volunteer in roles identical to their paid position at the same institution." .
helix:cs_worker_type__emeritus a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "emeritus" ; skos:prefLabel "Emeritus" ; skos:definition "Retired faculty or staff member granted emeritus status by the governing board. May retain certain privileges (email, library, office) but is not actively employed or compensated unless rehired." .
helix:cs_worker_type__postdoc a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "postdoc" ; skos:prefLabel "Postdoctoral Researcher" ; skos:definition "Individual holding a doctoral degree engaged in supervised research training. Classified as employee or trainee depending on funding source (NIH NRSA = trainee, institutional funds = employee)." .
helix:cs_worker_type__adjunct a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme helix:cs_worker_type ; skos:notation "adjunct" ; skos:prefLabel "Adjunct Faculty" ; skos:definition "Part-time faculty hired on a per-course or per-term basis without tenure eligibility. Typically compensated per credit hour or per course. May be subject to ACA hour tracking for benefits eligibility." .
